# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:7
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_43d50239:

    # "With the sounds of iron and steel reverberating into the sky, we marched towards the gate into the city."
    "쇠와 강철이 하늘에 울려 퍼지는 가운데, 우리는 도시로 향하는 문을 향해 진군했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:8
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_da340953:

    # "Our forces had been bolstered with a hundred strong cavalry men from another division, whatever this ‘secret’ mission was, it must be very important."
    "우리 병력은 다른 사단에서 온 백 명의 정예 기병으로 보강되었는데, 이 '비밀' 임무가 무엇이든, 분명 아주 중요한 것임에 틀림없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:10
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_31c1d805:

    # "Crowds came out to cheer us along the way, held back by rows of city guards acting as barriers so we could pass through unhindered."
    "군중들이 길을 따라 우리를 응원하기 위해 나왔고, 시 경비병들이 장벽 역할을 하여 우리가 방해받지 않고 통과할 수 있도록 막아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:11
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f3d4e862:

    # "Even with the adulation from the public, the tone was sombre given the many previous failed missions the Scouts had been made to embark on."
    "대중의 환호에도 불구하고, 정찰병들이 이전에 떠맡았던 많은 실패한 임무들을 생각하면 침울한 분위기였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:12
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_4a0e88d2:

    # "Some openly sobbed, others desperately tried to cheer us on with cries of \"Go get em’ boys!\" and \"Come home safe!\"."
    "어떤 이들은 공공연히 흐느꼈고, 다른 이들은 \"가서 잡아라, 친구들!\"과 \"무사히 집에 돌아와!\"라고 외치며 필사적으로 우리를 응원했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:13
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_e69e1431:

    # "Suddenly, from the side, I heard a familiar voice cry out to me."
    "갑자기, 옆에서 익숙한 목소리가 나를 부르는 소리가 들렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:15
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_78263ad0:

    # REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]!"
    REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:17
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d9748f84:

    # "Upon hearing the sweet voice and realising who it was, I looked over across the immense crowd and saw her among it as she desperately reached out to wave and cheer me on."
    "달콤한 목소리를 듣고 누군지 깨닫자, 나는 광대한 군중 너머를 바라보았고, 그녀가 필사적으로 손을 뻗어 나에게 손을 흔들며 응원하는 모습을 보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:18
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d7e14922:

    # MC "[regina_ref_cap!t]!"
    MC "[regina_ref_cap!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:19
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_dd7a3de5:

    # REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]! Come home safe! I love you!"
    REGINA @ talk "\"[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]! 무사히 집에 돌아와! 사랑해!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:21
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_75f1da76:

    # "She was swept back by the tidal wave of people as she struggled to keep herself behind the barriers set up, waving frantically towards me."
    "그녀는 사람들의 파도에 휩쓸려 뒤로 밀려났고, 설치된 장벽 뒤에 머물려고 애쓰며 미친 듯이 내게 손을 흔들고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:22
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8038d5d9:

    # "Damn..."
    "젠장..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:23
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a735250d:

    # "We marched on through the throngs of people, as we approached the archway to leave my ears picked another familiar voice from the crowd."
    "우리는 군중 속을 계속 진군했고, 도시를 떠나는 아치길에 다다랐을 때 내 귀가 군중 속에서 또 다른 익숙한 목소리를 포착했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:25
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9f20f220:

    # ADARA @ sad "[player_name!t]!"
    ADARA @ sad "[player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:26
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cd3c31fb:

    # "Somehow Adara had managed to burst through the rows of guards keeping the crowds back and sprinted towards me, leaping on me in a frenzied embrace, tears welling in her eyes."
    "아다라는 어떻게든 군중을 막는 경비병들의 줄을 뚫고 나를 향해 달려와 열광적인 포옹으로 내게 뛰어들었고, 그녀의 눈에는 눈물이 맺혀 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:27
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_2e5d551e:

    # MC "Adara, what are you doing here? You should be—"
    MC "\"아다라, 여기서 뭐 하는 거야? 너는—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:29
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f00b98b9:

    # ADARA @ sad "I had to come! I had to say goodbye!"
    ADARA @ sad "\"와야만 했어! 작별 인사를 해야 했어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:30
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b007e3a5:

    # MC "Adara..."
    MC "\"아다라...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:32
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0c094b67:

    # "Without hesitation, Adara sprung forward and planted a kiss onto my lips, her fingers twined through my hair as she clung to me one last time."
    "주저함 없이, 아다라는 앞으로 달려들어 내 입술에 입을 맞췄고, 그녀의 손가락이 내 머리카락에 얽히며 마지막으로 한 번 더 내게 매달렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:33
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a2155810:

    # ADARA @ sad "G-Goodluck, [player_name!t]!"
    ADARA @ sad "\"ㄱ-행운을 빌어, [player_name!t]!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:34
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_19748f64:

    # MC "... Adara... I..."
    MC "\"... 아다라... 나는...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:35
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_205d5740:

    # ADARA @ sad "C-Come home, please, to me!"
    ADARA @ sad "\"제-제발 집에 돌아와, 나에게로!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:37
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5989b69b:

    # "The guards began to pull Adara away, she cried out to me in anguish, her hands still outstretched."
    "경비병들이 아다라를 끌어내기 시작했고, 그녀는 고통 속에서 내게 소리쳤으며, 그녀의 두 손은 여전히 내게 뻗어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:40
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8d6c5e6e:

    # GUARD "GET BACK! Get back I say!"
    GUARD "\"물러서! 물러서라고!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:41
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_faad54e7:

    # ADARA @ sad "{i}Come home, [player_name!t]!{/i}"
    ADARA @ sad "\"{i}집에 돌아와, [player_name!t]!{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:42
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_284b806f:

    # ADARA @ sad "I’ll be waiting for you!"
    ADARA @ sad "\"기다리고 있을게!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:46
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_74f83b13:

    # "I shook my head to try and regain some focus as our procession marched out into the Valley of Death."
    "우리 행렬이 죽음의 계곡으로 진군할 때, 정신을 차리려고 고개를 저었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:52
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_46e46050:

    # "We marched for hours along the desolate, barren roads of this dead world."
    "우리는 이 죽은 세상의 황량하고 메마른 길을 따라 몇 시간 동안 진군했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:53
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ee910ba6:

    # "Here and there were scorched out wooden houses long since abandoned and overturned carts still laden with rotten food."
    "여기저기엔 오래전에 버려진 불탄 목조 주택들과 썩은 음식이 아직 실려 있는 뒤집힌 수레들이 놓여 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:54
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ddb3e81f:

    # "Much of this land was utterly devastated during The Great Siege of Novaras in 1152, turning much of the surrounding land into a dustbowl."
    "이 땅의 대부분은 1152년 노바라스 대공성전 동안 완전히 황폐화되어, 주변 땅 대부분을 먼지 구덩이로 변모시켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:55
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_96e63e82:

    # "However, if you were able to survive long enough to venture to the other side, greenery could once again be found."
    "하지만 반대편까지 모험을 떠날 만큼 오래 살아남을 수 있다면, 다시금 녹지를 발견할 수 있을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:56
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_308be420:

    # "The roads were littered with the skeletal remains of previous travellers."
    "길에는 이전 여행자들의 해골 잔해가 흩어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:57
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d32561da:

    # "Perhaps most ominously of all, in one burned out hut we have found what was left of a family sitting at a dinner table, their bones now lost amongst the carcass of their meal."
    "아마도 가장 섬뜩한 것은, 불에 탄 오두막 하나에서 우리가 발견한 것은 식탁에 앉아 있는 한 가족의 잔해였으며, 그들의 뼈는 이제 그들의 식사 잔해 속에 파묻혀 사라져 버렸다는 점이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:58
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cac73c98:

    # "In the mad rush to Novaras during the war, hundreds in their droves fled to the Capital, the last {i}true{/i} safe haven at the time."
    "전쟁 중 노바라스를 향한 광란의 질주 속에서, 수백 명이 떼 지어 수도로 도망쳤다. 그 당시 마지막 {i}진정한{/i} 안전한 피난처로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:59
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3832acc8:

    # "Many starved along the way and many were lost in the congested crowds to be trampled and left on the wayside."
    "많은 이들이 가는 길에 굶어 죽었고, 많은 이들이 붐비는 군중 속에서 길을 잃어 짓밟혀 길가에 버려졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:60
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d366a6d1:

    # "It was only thanks to Emperor Alcott, then just the son of a fledgling lord who had died some months prior, who’d rallied together the bannermen and held off the onslaught of Demorai while the others squabbled and bickered amongst themselves."
    "이는 오로지 알콧 황제 덕분이었다. 당시 그는 몇 달 전에 세상을 떠난 신생 영주의 아들에 불과했지만, 깃발병들을 규합하여 다른 이들이 서로 말다툼하고 싸우는 동안 데모라이의 맹공격을 막아냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:61
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ad343ca4:

    # "Mesamor must have been pleased and presumed Alcott may prove to be the next Newheart."
    "메사모르는 분명 기뻐했을 것이고, 알콧이 차세대 뉴하트가 될 것이라고 짐작했을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:62
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b85d83e9:

    # "I doubt in a million years that he would have predicted that Alcott would one day rise up and overthrow him."
    "그가 언젠가 알콧이 일어나 자신을 전복시키리라고 예상했을 리 만무하다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:66
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9ee03850:

    # DUPREY "ONWARD MARCH!"
    DUPREY "\"계속 진군!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:68
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3cc36384:

    # "Captain Duprey himself rode by horse, leading us from the front. We constantly peered out across the deadlands for any signs of the Demorai, but rather unnervingly could not locate even a whisper of them."
    "뒤프리 대위가 직접 말을 타고 우리를 선두에서 이끌었다. 우리는 끊임없이 죽음의 땅 너머로 데모라이의 흔적을 찾아 헤맸지만, 놀랍게도 그들의 속삭임조차 찾을 수 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:71
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d277cc6e:

    # "A couple hours into the slow, tedious march, the young First Officer rode up along beside us on a horse and peered down inquisitively."
    "느리고 지루한 행군이 시작된 지 몇 시간쯤 지나, 젊은 부관이 말을 타고 우리 옆으로 다가와 호기심 어린 눈으로 내려다보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:73
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8dda77c4:

    # "Second in command to Captain Duprey, he was notorious for being a dry, unemotional man."
    "뒤프리 대위의 부관으로서, 그는 무미건조하고 감정이 없는 사람으로 악명 높았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:75
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d63beaa1:

    # BORRAS "You three, come with me."
    BORRAS "\"너희 셋, 따라와라.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:76
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5a5784d5:

    # "Me, Markus and Kiara shared a look, all of us confused."
    "나와 마커스, 키아라는 서로를 바라보았고, 우리 모두 혼란스러워했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:78
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_def6eabf:

    # BORRAS "Yes, you three idiots, come, now."
    BORRAS "\"그래, 너희 바보 셋, 어서 오라고.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:82
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_29aaa368:

    # "Uneasy, we strayed away from the main bulk of the force and followed Borras down towards the front of the line towards Captain Duprey."
    "불안한 마음에, 우리는 주력 부대에서 벗어나 보라스를 따라 대열의 최전방, 뒤프리 대위에게로 향했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:85
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3e19d25d:

    # BORRAS "Captain, I’d like to give these Scouts some horses so they can come with me and loop around onto the ridge of the gorge."
    BORRAS "\"대위님, 이 정찰병들에게 말을 주어 저와 함께 협곡의 능선으로 우회하도록 하고 싶습니다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:86
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_352d9cf7:

    # "The Captain gave us a cursory glance."
    "대위가 우리를 대충 훑어보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:87
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_19e696bc:

    # DUPREY "... With just these three?"
    DUPREY "\"... 이 셋만 데리고?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:89
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_1fe10c4e:

    # BORRAS "I think we’ll draw too much attention with any more. It’s unlikely, but the Demorai may have used the gorge to lay a trap."
    BORRAS "\"더 많으면 너무 주목을 끌 거라고 생각합니다. 가능성은 낮지만, 데모라이가 협곡을 이용해 함정을 팠을 수도 있습니다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:90
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ee7738ae:

    # DUPREY "Hmm, permission granted, but make sure you’re careful with any engagement."
    DUPREY "\"흠, 허가한다. 하지만 어떤 교전이든 각별히 조심하게.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:92
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ae730759:

    # BORRAS "Yes Captain, I’ll ride back and report if there’s any trouble."
    BORRAS "\"알겠습니다, 대위님. 문제가 생기면 돌아와 보고하겠습니다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:94
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_7de322a9:

    # "Borras whistled and waved over some of the men who trotted the horses over towards us."
    "보라스가 휘파람을 불어 병사들에게 손짓했고 그들은 말들을 우리 쪽으로 끌고 왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:95
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5196c965:

    # "Taking the reins of the horses he handed them to each of us."
    "말들의 고삐를 잡아 그가 우리 각자에게 건넸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:96
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_672f0a56:

    # BORRAS "I take it you can all ride?"
    BORRAS "\"다들 말 탈 줄 안다고 생각하나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:97
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_06928b06:

    # MARKUS "Yes."
    MARKUS "\"그럼.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:98
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_617596c2:

    # KIARA "Aye."
    KIARA "\"예.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:99
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_34986cf2:

    # MC "Uhh, somewhat."
    MC "\"어, 어느 정도는요.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:101
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d20687d6:

    # BORRAS "‘Somewhat’?"
    BORRAS "\"'어느 정도'라고?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:102
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_01a2fa01:

    # MC "It’s been a while, sir..."
    MC "\"꽤 오랜만입니다, 선배님...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:103
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f7f37700:

    # MC "Can I ask why you’re taking us and not more experienced cavalry?"
    MC "\"왜 우리를 데려가고 더 경험 많은 기병들은 데려가지 않는지 물어봐도 될까요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:105
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0938623b:

    # BORRAS "I’m not risking cavalry men, you lot die, I just need to find a couple of new horses."
    BORRAS "\"기병들을 위험에 빠뜨리지 않으려는 거다. 너희가 죽어 봤자 난 그냥 새 말 몇 마리만 구하면 된다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:107
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cf030dfb:

    # BORRAS "They die and I’m looking at months of training to get new recruits up to {i}my{/i} standards."
    BORRAS "\"그들이 죽으면 신병들을 {i}내{/i} 기준에 맞추기까지 몇 달의 훈련이 필요하니까.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:108
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9d2b800f:

    # "Well... that’s not very confidence inspiring."
    "음... 그다지 자신감을 북돋아 주는 말은 아니군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:110
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cca1be84:

    # BORRAS "Now, enough questions! Come!"
    BORRAS "\"자, 질문은 이제 됐다! 따라와!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:118
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b3d75520:

    # "Riding up behind Borras, we furtively looped around to the high ground of the ridge."
    "보라스 뒤에서 말을 타고, 우리는 은밀히 협곡 능선의 고지대로 우회했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:119
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_c4e0e0aa:

    # "If there were any Demorai waiting up there, they could easily clamber down from the sides and surround the men in minutes."
    "저 위에 데모라이들이 기다리고 있다면, 그들은 쉽게 측면에서 기어 내려와 몇 분 안에 병사들을 포위할 수 있을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:120
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a72abee1:

    # "Thankfully, as we trotted up to overlook the valley beneath, we couldn’t see any enemies lurking."
    "다행히도, 우리가 아래 계곡을 내려다보기 위해 말을 몰고 올라왔을 때, 숨어 있는 적은 전혀 보이지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:121
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_671404c3:

    # "{i}But...{/i} I had an eerie feeling we were being watched by something, somewhere..."
    "{i}하지만...{/i} 어딘가에서 무언가가 우릴 지켜보고 있다는 섬뜩한 느낌이 들었어..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:123
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0126a5da:

    # BORRAS "Hmph... Looks like the path is clear."
    BORRAS "\"흠... 길이 깨끗한 것 같군.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:125
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b17da576:

    # KIARA "Are we done here then?"
    KIARA "\"그럼 여기서 끝인가?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:126
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_246621e2:

    # BORRAS "Yes, we’re—"
    BORRAS "\"그래, 우리는—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:128
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_299bf44a:

    # "Bursting out of the sand, a dozen Demorai surrounded us!" with flash
    "모래 속에서 튀어나와, 열두 명의 데모라이가 우리를 포위했다!" with flash

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:131
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5c2db7e6:

    # BORRAS "AMBUSH!!"
    BORRAS "\"매복이다!!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:149
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0657be32:

    # BORRAS "{i}*Huff* *Huff*{/i} Bastards... Little fuckers get everywhere..."
    BORRAS "\"{i}*헉* *헉*{/i} 개자식들... 쪼그만 놈들이 어디에나 숨어 있네...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:150
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d2c4fcfe:

    # MC "Is everyone okay?"
    MC "\"다들 괜찮아?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:151
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_29fd7387:

    # KIARA "Phew! I think so!"
    KIARA "\"휴! 괜찮은 것 같아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:153
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ba198da4:

    # MARKUS "One nearly took my damn head off!"
    MARKUS "\"내 머리통을 날려버릴 뻔했어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:154
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3a3c4790:

    # MC "Is that all of them?"
    MC "\"그게 전부인가?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:155
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_49747699:

    # BORRAS "Most likely, they weren’t a main fighting force, just spies, probably been watching us since we left the gate..."
    BORRAS "\"아마도 그럴 거다. 주력 전투 부대는 아니고 정찰병일 뿐이야. 아마 우리가 성문을 떠날 때부터 지켜보고 있었을 거다...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:156
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_258d99b7:

    # BORRAS "{i}Fuck...{/i} The Captain needs to hear about this."
    BORRAS "\"{i}젠장...{/i} 대위님께 이 사실을 알려야 해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:157
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_e03386ef:

    # BORRAS "Alright, come! Let’s get back and join the main force!"
    BORRAS "\"좋아, 따라와! 본대로 복귀하자!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:164
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8d2697e9:

    # "We rode back with Borras, grateful to be re-joining our ranks."
    "우리는 보라스와 함께 말을 타고 돌아왔고, 우리 대열에 다시 합류할 수 있어서 다행이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:166
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_e4dde03b:

    # "Flooded with adrenaline and in spite of the blood now seeping into the cracks of our armour, we were exhilarated at not only having survived, but having been {i}victorious{/i} over our enemies."
    "아드레날린이 넘쳐흐르고 갑옷 틈새로 스며드는 피에도 불구하고, 우리는 살아남았을 뿐만 아니라 적을 상대로 {i}승리{/i}했다는 사실에 도취되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:168
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_79c3bbe6:

    # "Even though we knew we had only fought a fledgling force, it was our first real taste of battle... and victory."
    "비록 우리가 신출내기 병력과 싸웠을 뿐이라는 걸 알았지만, 이것은 우리의 첫 진짜 전투... 그리고 승리의 맛이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:171
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_485f2b7b:

    # "As we had passed through the gorge into the open plains, we set up camp for the evening and soon had fires crackling, hot ash swelling up into the air above us."
    "협곡을 지나 개활지로 들어서자, 우리는 저녁에 야영지를 세웠고 곧 모닥불이 타오르며 뜨거운 재가 우리 위의 공기로 피어올랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:172
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_232f1f1f:

    # "Men patrolled around the borders of the camp on lookout for any signs of Demorai."
    "병사들이 야영지 경계를 순찰하며 데모라이의 징후가 없는지 감시했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:173
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_4ccf8569:

    # "For now, with a cup of mead in hand, I was free to do as I wished..."
    "당장은, 벌꿀술 한 잔을 손에 들고, 나는 원하는 대로 자유롭게 행동할 수 있었다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:182
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_ebad291c:

    # MC "Hey, you okay?"
    MC "\"야, 괜찮아?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:183
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_0ee1f5d9:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... A little shook-up still after the ridge..."
    MARKUS "\"응... 능선 일 때문에 아직 좀 충격이 가시질 않아서...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:186
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_756e086c:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Yeah... I know that."
    MARKUS "\"{i}*한숨*{/i} 응... 알고 있어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:187
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_72c29a7e:

    # MARKUS "And we’ll know what we’re doing more next time..."
    MARKUS "\"그리고 다음엔 우리가 뭘 해야 하는지 더 잘 알게 될 거야...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:188
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_9af57c44:

    # MC "And I’ve got your back!"
    MC "\"그리고 내가 뒤를 지켜줄게!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:189
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_692082b7:

    # MARKUS "Heh, good to know."
    MARKUS "\"헤, 다행이네.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:191
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_0329c2ae:

    # MARKUS "You guys did, I nearly got killed."
    MARKUS "\"너희는 해냈는데, 난 죽을 뻔했어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:192
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_e21a14b9:

    # MC "You held your own."
    MC "\"너도 잘 버텼어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:193
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_0f9e5fbb:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... but—"
    MARKUS "\"그래... 하지만—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:194
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_9337d3aa:

    # MC "Markus, it was our first real fight and we won, take the win."
    MC "\"마커스, 이건 우리 첫 진짜 전투였고 우리가 이겼어. 승리를 받아들여.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:195
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_50d2f182:

    # MARKUS "... Yeah... You’re right."
    MARKUS "\"... 그래... 네 말이 맞아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:197
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_99fc9dc3:

    # MARKUS "Ahhh, you’re right!"
    MARKUS "\"아아, 네 말이 맞아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:198
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_1287cbc3:

    # MARKUS "Without this outrageously gorgeous face, the girls would only have this god-like body to look at, poor things, I’d have to start walking around shirtless so they don’t get too distraught!"
    MARKUS "\"이 엄청나게 잘생긴 얼굴이 없으면, 여자들은 이 신 같은 몸만 바라봐야 하니까. 불쌍한 것들, 내가 상의를 벗고 돌아다녀야 그 애들이 너무 비탄에 빠지지 않을 거야!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:199
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_1e2f333f:

    # MARKUS "Let’s be honest though, at that point you’d just have to throw in the towel and accept that women would come from miles around just to have a glimpse."
    MARKUS "\"솔직히 말해서, 그쯤 되면 그냥 포기하고 여자들이 한 번 보겠다고 몇 마일 밖에서도 몰려올 거라고 인정해야 할걸.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:200
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_bf22b92d:

    # MC "Naturally."
    MC "\"당연하지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:201
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_716922e3:

    # MARKUS "... Thanks..."
    MARKUS "\"... 고마워...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:202
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_24cf381e:

    # MARKUS "... I need to do better; I can’t let you and the others down again like that."
    MARKUS "\"... 난 더 잘해야 해. 너랑 다른 애들을 또 그렇게 실망시킬 순 없어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:203
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_043833da:

    # MC "We’ll be alright, Markus; we just need to stick together."
    MC "\"우린 괜찮을 거야, 마커스. 우리가 뭉쳐 있기만 하면 돼.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:204
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_e1e483df:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... I know..."
    MARKUS "\"그래... 나도 알아...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:205
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_d4605351:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]?"
    MARKUS  "[player_name!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:206
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_dd7df583:

    # MC "Yeah?"
    MC "\"응?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:207
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_8bb8d277:

    # MARKUS "If I get hurt out there and it’s me or you..."
    MARKUS "\"만약 밖에서 내가 다치고 너 아니면 나라면...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:208
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_54b744a8:

    # MC "Markus, don’t—"
    MC "\"마커스, 그런 말—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:209
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_ad64bf7f:

    # MARKUS "Leave me, save yourself."
    MARKUS "\"날 두고 가. 너라도 살아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:210
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_830fc56f:

    # MC "It’s not going to come to that. "
    MC "\"그런 일은 없을 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:211
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_c982c6f0:

    # MARKUS "Just promise me you will... if it does."
    MARKUS "\"그냥... 만약 그렇게 된다면 약속해 줘.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:212
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC  "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:213
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_7c1e598c:

    # MARKUS "You’re like a brother, [player_name!t]. I can’t let you die for me."
    MARKUS "\"넌 나한테 형제나 다름없어, [player_name!t]. 내가 널 위해 죽게 할 순 없어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:214
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_f2cdcf5c:

    # MC "Pretty sure Adara would kill us herself if one of us left the other behind."
    MC "\"우리 중 하나가 다른 하나를 버리면 아다라가 직접 우릴 죽일 걸.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:215
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkMarkus_2c9109ec:

    # MARKUS "Oh yes! Although I reckon my death would be a particularly slow and painful one if it was me abandoning you..."
    MARKUS "\"아, 맞아! 근데 내가 널 버리면 내 죽음은 특히 더 느리고 고통스러울 것 같긴 하다...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:216
