translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_22830f38:

    # KIARA @ sad "Hmm... Shame."
    KIARA @ sad "\"흠... 아쉽네.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:303
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_1c63ed97:

    # MC "Sorry, I really am."
    MC "\"미안해, 정말로.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:304
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_285c5e65:

    # KIARA "I hope ya wee lady friend knows how lucky she is."
    KIARA "\"네 그 작은 여자 친구가 자기가 얼마나 운이 좋은지 알았으면 좋겠다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:305
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_2c461d5d:

    # MC "She’s not my—"
    MC "\"걔는 내—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:306
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_dc9cdd55:

    # MC "Like I said, it’s complicated."
    MC "\"말했듯이, 복잡해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:307
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_c32c0b7f:

    # KIARA "Aye... It always is."
    KIARA "\"응... 늘 그렇지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:308
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_309da993:

    # KIARA "... Say, how did you and that friend of yours meet?"
    KIARA "\"... 그런데, 너랑 그 친구는 어떻게 만난 거야?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:309
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_e79ed82a_1:

    # MC "Huh?"
    MC "\"응?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:310
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_c2d81723:

    # KIARA "Ya friend, the pale one? Thinks he’s God’s gift?"
    KIARA "\"그 친구 말이야, 창백한 애? 자기가 신의 선물인 줄 아는?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:311
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_56bb8c5f:

    # MC "Markus?"
    MC "\"마커스?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:312
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_80eb2716:

    # KIARA "That’s the one!"
    KIARA "\"그래, 그 친구!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:313
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_39610e60:

    # MC "Heh, we’ve always known each other, ever since we were little."
    MC "\"헤, 우린 항상 알고 지냈어, 아주 어릴 때부터.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:314
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_2a334d16:

    # KIARA "Oh?"
    KIARA "\"오?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:315
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_fe21d77e:

    # MC "Even got sent to the same class. We’ve always been inseparable."
    MC "\"같은 반으로 배정받기까지 했어. 우린 항상 떼려야 뗄 수 없는 사이였지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:316
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_dbb35441:

    # KIARA "That must be nice to have a friend like that."
    KIARA "\"그런 친구가 있다니 좋겠다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:317
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_693afd63:

    # MC "Yeah... We made all these plans about us both getting into the palace, wooing all the girls and becoming real big shots."
    MC "\"응... 우리 둘 다 궁전에 들어가서, 여자애들 꼬시고 진짜 거물이 되는 계획까지 세웠었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:318
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_01b567c0:

    # "Kiara laughed loudly."
    "키아라는 크게 웃었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:319
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_c7be471b:

    # KIARA @ happy "{i}Really?{/i} Don’t know why you’d want to spend your time with a bunch of wankers like that palace lot."
    KIARA @ happy "\"{i}진짜?{/i} 왜 그런 궁전 패거리 같은 얼간이들이랑 시간을 보내고 싶어 하는지 모르겠네.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:320
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_e3e750f4:

    # MC "Huh? "
    MC "\"어?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:321
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_fdce9aee:

    # MC "Most people idolise them."
    MC "\"대부분의 사람들은 그들을 우상화하는데.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:322
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_926dac37:

    # KIARA "Great if that’s what you’re into, but I couldn’t give less of a shit."
    KIARA "\"네 취향이면 좋겠지만, 난 전혀 관심 없어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:323
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_0a56fab8:

    # KIARA "Some failed king who fucked up, a bimbo queen made of ice, an arrogant prince who has no time for anyone, and a sickly-sweet princess who’s probably just a spoilt little brat that knows how to put on a show for the boys."
    KIARA "\"일을 망친 실패한 왕, 얼음으로 만들어진 바보 여왕, 누구에게도 시간을 내지 않는 오만한 왕자, 그리고 아마 남자들 앞에서 쇼를 할 줄 아는 그저 버릇없고 달콤한 척하는 공주.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:324
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_47a51fac:

    # MC "... I’ve never heard anyone talk about the royal family like that!"
    MC "\"... 왕실 가족에 대해 그렇게 말하는 사람은 처음 봤어!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:325
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_15bf13ba:

    # KIARA "Aye, I think you will find outside of your precocious Capital, we don’t all share the same reverence for a bunch of upper-class twats who do little more than wave at us from their gilded balconies."
    KIARA "\"응, 네 그 잘난 수도 바깥 세상에서는, 금박을 입힌 발코니에서 우리에게 손이나 흔드는 게 고작인 상류층 멍청이들 무리를 똑같이 숭배하지 않는다는 걸 알게 될 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:326
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_3fa41fed:

    # KIARA "... So, like I said, you’re better off without them, should be spending your time with some {i}real{/i} people."
    KIARA "\"... 그러니까, 내가 말했듯이, 그들 없이 지내는 게 나아. {i}진짜{/i} 사람들과 시간을 보내야지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:327
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_02166bb9:

    # MC "Yeah... Too bad the {i}‘real’{/i} people are all starving."
    MC "\"응... 근데 {i}'진짜'{/i} 사람들은 다 굶주리고 있다는 게 문제지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:328
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_ebc0d635:

    # KIARA "Aye, that’s why we’ve gotta get this war won, get back to looking after our own."
    KIARA "\"응, 그래서 우리가 이 전쟁을 이기고, 우리 사람들을 다시 돌봐야 하는 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:329
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_96ada1e9:

    # KIARA "... Anyway, go on, shoo, I’d better get back to my duties."
    KIARA "\"... 어쨌든, 가 봐, 슝. 나는 임무에 복귀하는 게 낫겠다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:330
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_1953ebce:

    # MC "Alright, talk soon."
    MC "\"알았어, 나중에 얘기해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:331
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_2efd37f9:

    # KIARA "Yeah... Talk soon."
    KIARA "\"응... 나중에 얘기해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:337
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_rep_71f72ca7:

    # MC "Hey."
    MC "\"안녕.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:338
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_rep_181644a0:

    # KIARA "Shoo, [player_name!t]. I need to stand watch."
    KIARA "\"슝, [player_name!t]. 경계 서야 해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:340
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_rep_142937d2:

    # KIARA @ happy "We'll see each other {i}later tonight{/i}, promise."
    KIARA @ happy "\"{i}오늘 밤 늦게{/i} 만날 거야, 약속해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:341
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkKiara_rep_615eedc7:

    # MC "Okay."
    MC "\"알았어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:348
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_000bea1b:

    # "Captain Duprey was sitting around one of the fires chatting to the men."
    "뒤프리 대위는 모닥불 하나에 둘러앉아 부하들과 담소를 나누고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:349
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_781f6770:

    # "As he gnawed into some bland looking chicken and swigged at his flask, he seemed more relaxed than usual as he spoke."
    "심심해 보이는 닭고기를 갉아먹고 플라스크를 홀짝이며, 그는 평소보다 편안해 보이며 말했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:350
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_b55e09f4:

    # "When he saw me approach, he looked and gave a small nod of his head."
    "그가 내가 다가오는 걸 보자, 쳐다보며 머리를 살짝 끄덕였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:353
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_caff3e37:

    # MC "Evening, Captain."
    MC "\"안녕하십니까, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:354
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_9f5fc7d6:

    # DUPREY "You are one of the lads Borras took up on the ridge earlier, yes?"
    DUPREY "\"너는 아까 보라스가 능선에 데려간 젊은이들 중 하나지?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:355
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_8cd502b3:

    # MC "Yes, sir."
    MC "\"예, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:356
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_0057be0d:

    # DUPREY "Hm, nicely done, lad."
    DUPREY "\"흠, 잘했다, 젊은이.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:357
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_217a3175:

    # "The Captain offered me a swig of his drink which I accepted gratefully, and then welcomed me to sit."
    "대위님이 자기 술을 한 모금 권했고 나는 감사히 받았으며, 그리고 나서 자리에 앉으라고 권했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:359
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_b4e53b47:

    # MC "Thank you, sir."
    MC "\"감사합니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:360
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_481f280e:

    # DUPREY "So, how’ve you settled in?"
    DUPREY "\"그래, 적응은 잘 되가나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:361
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_5adf567d:

    # MC "Fine I think, sir."
    MC "\"괜찮은 것 같습니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:362
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_b05e07d5:

    # DUPREY "Good, good..."
    DUPREY "\"좋아, 좋아...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:363
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_d7ab3938:

    # MC "... Could I ask you about a couple things, sir?"
    MC "\"... 몇 가지 여쭤봐도 될까요, 대위님?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:364
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_0c3978ea:

    # DUPREY "Hm?"
    DUPREY "\"응?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:365
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_d0300c61:

    # MC "If you don’t mind..."
    MC "\"괜찮으시다면...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:366
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_13a1b492:

    # DUPREY "Aye, feel free."
    DUPREY "\"그래, 편하게 물어봐.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:374
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_7bb579f6:

    # DUPREY "Lost count a long time ago."
    DUPREY "\"세는 걸 잊은 지 오래됐다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:375
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_6c8a02b9:

    # DUPREY "I’ve been here since the beginning..."
    DUPREY "\"난 처음부터 여기 있었다...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:376
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_dcc31424:

    # MC "You mean—"
    MC "\"설마—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:377
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c9e369aa:

    # DUPREY "When it all first started, we never took it seriously, far more concerned with the threat of Kalliban O’Nok and his army of orcs crossing the seas to invade..."
    DUPREY "\"그 모든 게 처음 시작됐을 땐, 우린 진지하게 받아들이지 않았어. 칼리반 오녹과 그의 오크 군대가 바다를 건너 침략할 위협에 훨씬 더 신경 쓰고 있었거든...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:378
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_d579e16c:

    # MC "{i}The winter of 1149.{/i}"
    MC "\"{i}1149년의 겨울.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:379
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_9b165412:

    # DUPREY "Alright, clever clogs. That’s what they called it, aye."
    DUPREY "\"그래, 똑똑하군. 그렇게 불렀지, 맞아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:380
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2d277bc7:

    # DUPREY "Villagers talked about {i}‘ghosts in the night’{/i} snatching people up... We figured it was just bandits."
    DUPREY "\"마을 사람들은 사람들을 납치하는 {i}'밤의 유령'{/i} 얘길 했었지... 우린 그냥 도적 떼인 줄 알았어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:381
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_4792dca5:

    # DUPREY "More ‘n’ more had been spotted what with all the famine; we were preoccupied with the kind of threats we could understand."
    DUPREY "\"기근 때문에 점점 더 많은 목격담이 나오고 있었고, 우린 우리가 이해할 수 있는 위협에만 신경 쓰고 있었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:382
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_8ba9597e:

    # MC "I know this part! After they found more and more bloody scenes, The High Lords and King Mesamor finally relented and got the High Mages and Inquisitors to investigate."
    MC "\"이 부분은 알아요! 점점 더 피비린내 나는 현장이 발견된 후에, 고위 귀족들과 메사모르 왕이 마침내 굴복해서 고위 마법사들과 종교 재판관들을 조사에 투입했죠.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:383
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_f269264d:

    # "Captain Duprey raised a curious eyebrow."
    "뒤프리 대장이 호기심 어린 눈썹을 치켜올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:384
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_ecde942b:

    # DUPREY @ think "Hmm... How’d you know all that? Most don’t know the full story."
    DUPREY @ think "\"흠... 그걸 어떻게 다 알지? 대부분은 전체 이야기를 몰라.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:385
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_1cc6d473:

    # MC "I studied it."
    MC "\"공부했습니다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:386
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_b77999dc:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Ha! How very wise of you..."
    DUPREY @ laugh "\"하하! 아주 현명하군...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:387
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c8488904:

    # DUPREY "Always good to know how you got to where you’re at but I’m afraid there aren’t many more lessons to learn from it that’d be useful."
    DUPREY "\"자네가 지금 어디에 와 있는지 아는 건 항상 좋지만, 거기서 더 배울 만한 유용한 교훈은 많지 않을 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:388
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_424524d9:

    # DUPREY "We underestimated the enemy, and we still thought at the time it was all some grand scheme from Kalliban. We overestimated him."
    DUPREY "\"우린 적을 과소평가했고, 그때도 그게 칼리반의 거대한 음모인 줄 알았어. 우린 그를 과대평가했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:389
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_04cc0520:

    # DUPREY "We were ordered to defend the neighbouring villages and towns when we should have had the army brought in and amassed an all-out assault, they’d caught us on the backfoot. We were still naive then."
    DUPREY "\"우린 이웃 마을과 도시들을 방어하라는 명령을 받았지만, 군대를 투입해서 전면 공격을 감행했어야 했어. 그들은 우리의 허를 찔렀지. 우린 아직 순진했어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:390
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_52865a48:

    # "Captain Duprey took another sip of his drink, he seemed lost in his memories."
    "뒤프리 대위는 술을 한 모금 더 들이켰고, 추억에 잠긴 듯 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:391
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_9841065b:

    # DUPREY "We paid the price for those mistakes at Meadow Plains."
    DUPREY "\"우린 그 실수들의 대가를 메도우 평원에서 치렀지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:392
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_1d6c3970:

    # MC "{i}You{/i} were at The Battle of Meadow Plains?"
    MC "\"{i}당신이{/i} 메도우 평원 전투에 계셨다고요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:393
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_a7267a8b:

    # DUPREY "That I was."
    DUPREY "\"그랬지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:394
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_3e8e0a2d:

    # DUPREY "I remember the bloodshed in the streets from the towns that had been annihilated."
    DUPREY "\"전멸당한 마을들의 거리에 흥건했던 피를 기억해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:395
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_22d390e2:

    # DUPREY "Every corner you turned around had death waiting for you on the other side."
    DUPREY "\"돌아서는 모퉁이마다 죽음이 반대편에서 기다리고 있었지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:396
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_36fdb802:

    # DUPREY "And there was the mad rush of thousands fleeing to Novaras to hide behind its walls."
    DUPREY "\"그리고 성벽 뒤에 숨으려고 노바라스로 도망치는 수천 명의 광란의 질주가 있었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:397
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_06bc1e0b:

    # DUPREY "The butchered bodies of the mages and Inquisitors before we arrived to offer relief."
    DUPREY "\"우리가 구원하러 도착하기 전에 학살당한 마법사들과 종교 재판관들의 시체들.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:398
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2020af46:

    # DUPREY "But most of all, I remember THAT battle."
    DUPREY "\"하지만 무엇보다도, 그 전투를 기억해.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:399
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_92a7cec2:

    # "We had all heard tales about the first great battle for Alderay and of how the ‘legendary General Newheart’ fell trying to relieve Fort Rook, the supposedly impenetrable Fortress of the South."
    "우리 모두는 알데레이를 위한 첫 대전투와, '전설의 뉴하트 장군'이 난공불락이라던 남부의 요새, 룩 요새를 구원하려다 전사했다는 이야기를 들어왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:400
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_6539d583:

    # MC "... Were you there when General Newheart—"
    MC "\"... 뉴하트 장군이—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:401
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_db751ab3:

    # DUPREY "Old Iron Heart? Aye, we were friends."
    DUPREY "\"무쇠 심장? 그래, 우린 친구였지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:403
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_975a2b8e:

    # MC "... No way!"
    MC "\"... 말도 안 돼!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:404
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_9b54e0a7:

    # MC "You knew General Newheart?"
    MC "\"뉴하트 장군을 아셨다고요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:405
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_de87c018:

    # MC "As in, THE Newheart? "
    MC "\"그러니까, 그 뉴하트 말이에요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:406
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e1d8f53c:

    # DUPREY "He always hated how they changed his name, Lucan Erunheart was his real name before he was ‘blessed’ with ‘Newheart, Defender of The Realm’."
    DUPREY "\"그는 자기 이름이 바뀐 걸 항상 싫어했지. 루칸 에룬하트가 그의 진짜 이름이었어. '영역의 수호자, 뉴하트'라는 '축복'을 받기 전까지는.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:407
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_409e8321:

    # DUPREY "But yes, I knew him alright."
    DUPREY "\"하지만 그래, 나는 그를 확실히 알았지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:408
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_191438df:

    # DUPREY "I was there at the war table with him; we strategized many a battle together."
    DUPREY "\"나는 그와 함께 전쟁 회의 테이블에 있었어. 우리는 수많은 전투를 함께 계획했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:409
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_8d6c11d2:

    # DUPREY "It was the two of us that pushed back Kalliban’s first invasion AND the Dark Elf King’s encroach. "
    DUPREY "\"칼리반의 첫 침략과 다크 엘프 왕의 침범을 밀어낸 것도 우리 둘이었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:410
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_89a0558d:

    # MC "That’s... That’s incredible!"
    MC "\"그건... 정말 대단해요!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:411
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_8523b42e:

    # DUPREY "Bah... I was a younger man back then, I ain’t as fast as I used to be."
    DUPREY "\"흥... 그땐 더 젊었지, 이젠 예전처럼 빠르지 않아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:412
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_77f64d26:

    # DUPREY "Newheart though? The best warrior I’d ever met and a brilliant commander in the field."
    DUPREY "\"하지만 뉴하트는? 내가 만난 최고의 전사였고 전장에서 뛰어난 지휘관이었지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:413
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_bc2aaa32:

    # DUPREY "Handsome bastard as well, got all the girls swooning after him."
    DUPREY "\"잘생긴 놈이기도 해서, 모든 여자애들이 그에게 홀딱 반했어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:414
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_0f58b1c0:

    # DUPREY "They still singing about him?"
    DUPREY "\"아직도 그에 대해 노래하나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:415
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_0453fc0f:

    # MC "All the time! The man’s a legend!"
    MC "\"항상이요! 그분은 전설이에요!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:416
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_d3379069:

    # MC "I can’t believe you actually met him! You’re bound to hear at least one song about him in any of the taverns once people have had a drink or two!"
    MC "\"실제로 그분을 만나셨다니 믿을 수가 없어요! 어느 선술집에서든 사람들이 한두 잔 마시면 그에 대한 노래를 적어도 한 곡은 듣게 될 거예요!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:417
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_3829efd5:

    # DUPREY @ think "Hmph..."
    DUPREY @ think "\"흠...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:418
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_cc702e61:

    # MC "... Where did it all go wrong?"
    MC "\"... 어디서부터 잘못된 건가요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:419
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_56d22cd3:

    # "The Captain had become morose as he reminisced, but his anger was now evident as his eyes glared into the embers of the fire."
    "대위는 회상하며 우울해졌지만, 그의 분노는 이제 모닥불의 잉걸불을 노려보는 눈빛에서 분명히 드러났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:420
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c44cfa87:

    # DUPREY "{i}Mesamor happened.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"{i}메사모르 때문이지.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:421
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_4a075af6:

    # MC "What do you mean?"
    MC "\"무슨 말씀이신가요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:422
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_95893d7d:

    # DUPREY "I mean that old prick decided the siege tactics we had laid out would have taken too long."
    DUPREY "\"내 말은 그 늙은 망나니가 우리가 세운 공성 전술이 너무 오래 걸릴 거라고 결정했단 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:423
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_182fc79b:

    # DUPREY "So, he decided in his infinite fucking wisdom to push through some other general’s much more aggressive strategy."
    DUPREY "\"그래서 그 무한한 지혜로, 다른 장군의 훨씬 더 공격적인 전략을 밀어붙이기로 결정했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:424
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_546d1fd8:

    # DUPREY "Mesamor couldn’t stand the idea of a prolonged war, he wanted to take back Fort Rook as quickly as possible and march south to take back everything else he’d lost."
    DUPREY "\"메사모르는 장기전을 견딜 수 없었어. 가능한 한 빨리 룩 요새를 탈환하고 남쪽으로 진군해서 잃은 모든 것을 되찾고 싶어 했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:425
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_90a9bd26:

    # MC "I take it you didn’t approve."
    MC "\"찬성하지 않으셨군요.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:426
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_07a85dee:

    # DUPREY "Years of actual battle experience and advice were cast out the window for the sake of bureaucracy, what do you think?"
    DUPREY "\"수년간의 실제 전투 경험과 조언이 관료제 때문에 창밖으로 던져졌어. 어떻게 생각하나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:427
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_fdd64753:

    # MC "... So, what do you remember of the battle itself?"
    MC "\"... 그럼, 전투 자체에 대해선 뭘 기억하시나요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:428
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_42fc440a:

    # DUPREY "Lots of fighting... Dead everywhere... I saw more bodies that day than most men see in a lifetime."
    DUPREY "\"엄청난 전투... 사방에 시체들... 그날 난 대부분의 남자들이 평생 보는 것보다 더 많은 시체를 봤어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:429
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_719f6fe6:

    # DUPREY "From all the smoke and what felt like an avalanche of blood, it was hard just to breathe, never mind making sense of the field..."
    DUPREY "\"연기와 마치 눈사태 같은 피 때문에 숨 쉬는 것조차 힘들었고, 전장을 파악하는 건 말할 것도 없었지...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:430
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_5b6ff3e4:

    # DUPREY "Across the way on a small hill, I saw Newheart in that shimmering armour you lot like singing about so much. "
    DUPREY "\"저쪽 작은 언덕 위에서, 너희들이 그렇게 노래 부르기 좋아하는 그 반짝이는 갑옷을 입은 뉴하트를 봤어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:431
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_021f89e6:

    # DUPREY "He stood alone against the Demorai General, a monstrous thing I can’t seem to forget even when I try..."
    DUPREY "\"그는 데모라이 장군에 홀로 맞섰지. 내가 아무리 잊으려 해도 잊히지 않는 괴물 같은 존재...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:432
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_5d817988:

    # DUPREY "{i}Zanarak.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"{i}자나락.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:433
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_cff33da7:

    # "{i}Zanarak{/i}, the bogeyman of every child in Alderay."
    "{i}자나락{/i}, 알데레이의 모든 아이들에게 겁을 주는 존재."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:434
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_0d9c3b4c:

    # "Stories spread far and wide of a supposed leader of the Demorai’s armies, unstoppable and ruthless, wings so large they could block out the sun and plunge an entire battlefield into a darkness as awful as himself..."
    "데모라이 군대의 지도자라는 소문이 사방으로 퍼졌다. 막을 수 없고 무자비하며, 날개가 너무 커서 태양을 가리고 전장 전체를 자신만큼 끔찍한 어둠 속으로 빠뜨릴 수 있다는..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:435
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_6cc1af85:

    # "Some doubt if he ever existed, so few survivors remain whenever he’s claimed to have been sighted and the tales they told were wilder than the legends of Newheart."
    "어떤 이들은 그가 실제로 존재했는지 의심한다. 그가 목격되었다고 주장될 때마다 생존자가 너무 적게 남고, 그들이 전하는 이야기는 뉴하트의 전설보다 더 기괴했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:436
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_ba79f724:

    # MC "He’s... {i}real?{/i}"
    MC "\"그가... {i}진짜라고요?{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:437
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_42eb289b:

    # DUPREY "As real as you and me, boy... Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "\"너와 나만큼이나 진짜야, 젊은이... 그건 확실히 알아둬.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:438
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_aaabade5:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} He fought bravely..."
    DUPREY "\"{i}*한숨*{/i} 그는 용감하게 싸웠어...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:439
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_445ed618:

    # MC "How did—"
    MC "\"어떻게—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:440
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_ab292432:

    # DUPREY "It took his head."
    DUPREY "\"그것이 그의 머리를 가져갔어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:441
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_7c0a6889:

    # DUPREY "I still remember that thing clutching him by the hair and holding it up for us all to see..."
    DUPREY "\"그 놈이 그의 머리카락을 움켜쥐고 우리 모두가 보라고 들어 올리던 게 아직도 기억나...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:442
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_42c2bad6:

    # DUPREY "Boasting of his kill, gloating at how easy it had been to take down the very best of us."
    DUPREY "\"자신의 살육을 자랑하며, 우리 최고 중의 최고를 쓰러뜨리는 게 얼마나 쉬웠는지 조롱하며.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:443
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_5ee5ad2c:

    # "A chilling sense of dread slithered into every bone in my body... {i}What if we encountered some monster Zanarak while we were scouting out here now?{/i}"
    "오싹한 공포가 내 몸의 모든 뼛속으로 스며들었다... {i}지금 여기서 정찰 중에 자나락 같은 괴물을 만나면 어쩌지?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:444
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_aa8fdbe9:

    # DUPREY "After that, you know the rest."
    DUPREY "\"그 후는, 나머지는 너도 알지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:445
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e8c1063f:

    # DUPREY "Lots of fighting, {i}Daggerfall.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"많은 전투, {i}대거폴.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:446
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_f2837818:

    # DUPREY "Mesamor deposed and Alcott declaring himself Emperor..."
    DUPREY "\"메사모르가 폐위되고 알콧이 스스로 황제임을 선언하고...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:447
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_eaa48d0c:

    # MC "Can I hear some more about Daggerfall?"
    MC "\"대거폴에 대해 좀 더 들을 수 있을까요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:448
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_75f1addb:

    # DUPREY "I’m not a history teacher, lad."
    DUPREY "\"난 역사 선생이 아니야, 젊은이.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:449
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_d246bf3c:

    # MC "I know sir, sorry I... guess I just to wish to hear from someone who was actually there."
    MC "\"알겠습니다, 대위님. 죄송합니다. 그냥... 실제로 거기 있었던 사람한테 듣고 싶을 뿐입니다.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:450
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e1044f79:

    # MC "I’m not sure how reliable those books we were given are."
    MC "\"우리에게 주어진 그 책들이 얼마나 믿을 만한지 잘 모르겠어서요.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:451
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_0014520a:

    # DUPREY "Hmph... Wise boy, you are... They probably try to paint a rosier picture than it really was."
    DUPREY "\"흠... 현명한 젊은이군... 그들은 아마 실제보다 더 장밋빛으로 그리려고 했을 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:452
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e9a51bd0:

    # DUPREY "Don’t wanna give you kids too many nightmares, we’d never get you fighting for us otherwise!"
    DUPREY "\"너희 애들한테 너무 많은 악몽을 주고 싶지 않아서지. 안 그러면 우릴 위해 싸워줄 리가 없잖아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:453
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_69ce2041:

    # DUPREY "Operation Daggerfall was our last real gamble."
    DUPREY "\"대거폴 작전은 우리의 마지막 도박이었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:454
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_a90a9028:

    # DUPREY "We had managed some years before, when the war with the Demorai first really started, to suspend previous conflicts and form a loose alliance with the other kingdoms and races;"
    DUPREY "\"데모라이와의 전쟁이 처음으로 진짜 시작됐을 때, 우리는 몇 년 전에 이전의 분쟁들을 중단하고 다른 왕국 및 종족들과 느슨한 동맹을 맺는 데 성공했었지;\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:455
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_077b901a:

    # DUPREY "Elves, Dwarves, Orcs, even the bloody Greater Trading Company..."
    DUPREY "\"엘프, 드워프, 오크, 심지어 그 빌어먹을 거대 무역 회사까지...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:456
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_005134d0:

    # DUPREY "Didn’t do much good though when the bastards kept showing up everywhere."
    DUPREY "\"하지만 그 개자식들이 사방에서 계속 나타나니까 별 도움이 안 됐어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:457
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c64175ec:

    # DUPREY "Following the failure of The Great Demorai Siege, we were in high spirits after our first major win."
    DUPREY "\"대 데모라이 공성전의 실패 이후, 우리는 첫 주요 승리 후에 사기가 높았어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:458
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_55e137af:

    # DUPREY "We tried pushing back harder and faster to reclaim the South, but we were losing far too many men."
    DUPREY "\"우리는 남부를 탈환하기 위해 더 세고 빠르게 밀어붙이려 했지만, 너무 많은 병력을 잃고 있었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:459
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_3792fe3b:

    # DUPREY "We had left people starving on the home front and many were starting to think the whole thing was a mistake, that a new strategy was needed."
    DUPREY "\"우리는 본토에서 사람들을 굶주리게 했고, 많은 이들이 모든 게 실수였고 새로운 전략이 필요하다고 생각하기 시작했어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:460
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_5e0c932f:

    # DUPREY "I still remember stealing boots from some dead lieutenant because mine were literally rotting away..."
    DUPREY "\"내 장화가 말 그대로 썩어 가고 있어서 어떤 죽은 중위한테서 장화를 훔쳤던 게 아직도 기억나...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:461
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c8369a76:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Then came {i}Daggerfall{/i}."
    DUPREY "\"{i}*한숨*{/i} 그러고 나서 {i}대거폴{/i}이 왔어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:462
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_928e3931:

    # "The Captain took another uneasy swig of his drink, as if pushing down some vile memory."
    "대위는 마치 어떤 끔찍한 기억을 억누르듯, 불편한 듯 술을 한 번 더 들이켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:463
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_dbc2b92f:

    # DUPREY "{i}Fucking Daggerfall.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"{i}빌어먹을 대거폴.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:464
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_6883b9ab:

    # MC "They tried to tell us in class that {i}Daggerfall{/i} wasn’t a total failure, that—"
    MC "\"수업에서 우리한테 {i}대거폴{/i}이 완전한 실패는 아니었다고 가르치려 했어요. 그게—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:465
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_99061ed9:

    # DUPREY "Oh, did they now?"
    DUPREY "\"오, 그래?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:466
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_78fa766f:

    # DUPREY "Bullshit, it was a disaster, and don’t you ever let any fancy prick in shiny armour who wasn’t even there tell you otherwise."
    DUPREY "\"개소리지, 그건 재앙이었어. 그리고 거기 있지도 않았던 반짝이는 갑옷 입은 어떤 잘난 놈이 다르게 말하게 내버려 두지 마.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:467
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2d204a49:

    # MC "..."
    MC  "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:468
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_fcc5db74:

    # DUPREY "It was Mesamor’s last real throw of the dice."
    DUPREY "\"그건 메사모르의 마지막 진짜 도박이었어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:469
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_bd72acb9:

    # DUPREY "He thought to divide the army in two and have them sweep down like scythes, hoping to crush the enemy between them on two fronts."
    DUPREY "\"그는 군대를 둘로 나누어 낫처럼 휩쓸며 내려가서, 두 전선 사이에서 적을 분쇄하려 했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:470
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_b1240136:

    # DUPREY "By that point, what was it? 1155? 1156 maybe?"
    DUPREY "\"그 시점에, 그게 언제였지? 1155년? 1156년쯤?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:471
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_d1ee329d:

    # DUPREY "Either way, we had neither the manpower nor the resources to pull it off, they quickly broke through our lines and we had to retreat, weaker than ever."
    DUPREY "\"어느 쪽이든, 우린 그걸 해낼 병력도 자원도 없었고, 그들은 금세 우리 전선을 돌파했으며 우리는 후퇴해야 했어. 그 어느 때보다 약해진 채로.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:472
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2e122687:

    # DUPREY "... After that, Alcott led his coup, Mesamor became just a puppet, a monarch in name and nothing more, and the kingdom got split into factions."
    DUPREY "\"... 그 후에, 알콧이 쿠데타를 주도했고, 메사모르는 그저 꼭두각시가 되었지. 이름만 군주일 뿐 그 이상도 이하도 아니었고, 왕국은 파벌로 갈라졌어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:473
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c49fd91e:

    # MC "... I see."
    MC "\"... 그렇군.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:477
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e3b0a5e0:

    # DUPREY "Don’t know, orders are to secure the site and bring back the relics, that’s it."
    DUPREY "\"모르겠다. 명령은 현장을 확보하고 유물을 가져오라는 것뿐이야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:478
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_35505111:

    # DUPREY "Frankly, I couldn’t give a shit about what we’re picking up."
    DUPREY "\"솔직히, 우리가 뭘 가져오는지 따위는 전혀 관심 없어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:479
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_4a7e500e:

    # DUPREY "In and out is my only concern."
    DUPREY "\"들어가고 나오는 게 유일한 관심사야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:482
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_439e127d:

    # DUPREY "My wife passed to fever."
    DUPREY "\"내 아내는 열병으로 세상을 떠났지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:483
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_328b738e:

    # MC "Oh... I’m sorry, sir."
    MC "\"아... 죄송합니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:484
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_1b214ce0:

    # DUPREY "It’s alright, it was during the mass fleeing to Novaras, wasn’t just people hiding behind those walls but plague and famine as well..."
    DUPREY "\"괜찮네, 그건 노바라스로 대탈출하던 중이었어. 그 성벽 뒤에 숨은 건 사람들뿐만 아니라 역병과 기근도 마찬가지였지...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:485
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_0b409594:

    # DUPREY "My wife was a beauty... She was ravaged by the plague and her body just gave up eventually."
    DUPREY "\"내 아내는 미인이었어... 역병에 휩쓸려 결국 몸이 버티지 못했지.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:486
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2a4eac44:

    # DUPREY "My daughter is alive though, somewhere up north in Angmurus, helping with the negotiations."
    DUPREY "\"하지만 내 딸은 살아 있어. 북쪽 앙무루스 어딘가에 있지, 협상을 돕고 있어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:487
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_2d204a49_1:

    # MC "..."
    MC  "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:488
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_28466b5a:

    # DUPREY @ happy "Feisty little thing let me know straight up she’d learn how to swing an axe like me! Ha!"
    DUPREY @ happy "\"기운찬 녀석이 나한테 당당히 말했어, 나처럼 도끼 휘두르는 법을 배우겠다고! 하!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:489
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_912dda56:

    # DUPREY "Lord... I haven’t seen her in... {i}eight years{/i} now."
    DUPREY "\"주여... 이제 그 애를 못 본 지... {i}8년{/i}이 됐어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:490
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_ad9d3945:

    # MC "Do you know if she’s okay?"
    MC "\"그녀가 괜찮은지 아세요?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:491
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_c343a50d:

    # DUPREY "We exchange letters monthly, and I still receive reports on her from time to time, mostly trouble that she’s been causing..."
    DUPREY "\"우린 매달 편지를 주고받고, 나는 여전히 때때로 그 애에 대한 보고를 받아. 대부분은 그녀가 일으키는 문제들이지...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:492
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_d3e2f307:

    # DUPREY "When this is over, it’ll be good to see her again... I’d like to see that axe swing of her myself one day!"
    DUPREY "\"이게 끝나면, 그 애를 다시 보는 게 좋겠어... 언젠가 그녀의 도끼질을 직접 보고 싶군!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:493
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_3be6f501:

    # DUPREY "... How about you? Anyone back home?"
    DUPREY "\"... 자네는 어떤가? 집에 기다리는 사람 있나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:494
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_eeb626c5:

    # MC "Yeah... There’s a few people waiting for me."
    MC "\"네... 저를 기다리는 사람이 몇 명 있어요.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:495
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_ad8c989c:

    # DUPREY "Hm... That’s good... You think of them... They’ll give you a reason to survive when you need it."
    DUPREY "\"흠... 그거 좋군... 그들을 생각하게... 필요할 때 살아남을 이유를 줄 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:500
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_e7e53552:

    # MC "That's all, sir."
    MC "\"이상입니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:501
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_a5617ab8:

    # DUPREY "Enjoy your evening, boy."
    DUPREY "\"좋은 저녁 보내게, 젊은이.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:502
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_menu_cec2f66c:

    # MC "Captain."
    MC "\"대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:507
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_rep_cec2f66c:

    # MC "Captain."
    MC "\"대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:508
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_rep_df42c9dc:

    # DUPREY "Enjoy the rest of your evening now, boy."
    DUPREY "\"이제 그만 쉬게나, 젊은이.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:509
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkDuprey_rep_d3f4e1d4:

    # MC "Aye Captain."
    MC "\"알겠습니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:517
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkBorras_8c638585:

    # MC "Sir."
    MC "\"선배님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:518
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkBorras_aee6c745:

    # BORRAS "Hm? Oh, it’s you."
    BORRAS "\"응? 오, 너구나.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:519
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkBorras_0a1b45ef:

    # BORRAS "Nicely done out there on the ridge earlier."
    BORRAS "\"아까 능선에서 잘했어.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:520
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_CampTalkBorras_b4e53b47:

    # MC "Thank you, sir."
