    # "Mounted on horseback, we headed off towards the front of the march where Captain Duprey gazed ominously ahead."
    "말에 올라탄 채, 우리는 뒤프리 대위가 앞을 불길하게 응시하는 행군의 최선두를 향해 나아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:783
