    # "Duprey’s steely eyes stayed on the horizon, unflinching."
    "뒤프리의 강철 같은 눈빛이 수평선에 고정되어, 움찔하지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:786
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d6506570:

    # BORRAS "What is it, Captain, what do you see?"
    BORRAS "\"뭡니까, 대위님? 뭐가 보이십니까?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:787
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7df8ffad:

    # "He pointed towards the furthest house."
    "그가 가장 먼 집을 가리켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:788
