    # DUPREY "Movement. {i}There.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"움직임. {i}저기.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:789
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_84f75530:

    # "Borras’ eyes narrowed as he squinted at the house but clearly couldn’t see anything."
    "보라스의 눈이 집을 향해 가늘어졌지만 분명 아무것도 볼 수 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:790
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_df2702a3:

    # "There was a deathly silence in the air as he turned to look back at us, inclined his head towards the house and sealed our fate."
    "그가 우리를 돌아보며, 집 쪽으로 고개를 기울여 우리의 운명을 결정지었을 때, 공기 중에는 죽음의 침묵이 흘렀다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:791
