translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_330b0694:

    # DUPREY "{i}Be careful.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"{i}조심해.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:799
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_cebf11be:

    # "Cantering apprehensively behind Borras, we made our way towards the lone house."
    "불안한 마음으로 보라스의 뒤를 따라 말을 달리며, 우리는 외딴 집을 향해 나아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:805
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_9a415e97:

    # "As we made our way closer, we could hear the sounds of crying growing louder, we each gave the other perplexed looks."
    "더 가까이 다가가자, 울음소리가 점점 커지는 걸 들을 수 있었고, 우리 각자는 서로에게 당혹스러운 표정을 주고받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:806
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_2955a272:

    # "We knew there were people still living out here, but most had long since moved into other kingdoms or were well hidden..."
    "우리는 아직 여기 밖에 사람들이 살고 있다는 걸 알고 있었지만, 대부분은 오래전에 다른 왕국으로 이주했거나 잘 숨어 있었다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:807
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a5e1b52d:

    # "As we peered into the ruins, there sat a woman, long brown hair tangled between her fingers as she sobbed hysterically into her hands."
    "폐허 속을 들여다보자, 한 여인이 앉아 있었고, 긴 갈색 머리가 손가락 사이에 얽힌 채 손에 얼굴을 묻고 히스테릭하게 흐느끼고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:808
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_508384cc:

    # "All skin and bones, the palest white I’d ever seen a person."
    "뼈와 가죽뿐이고, 내가 본 사람 중 가장 창백했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:809
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_051be726:

    # "Naked and huddled over, she barely looked human."
    "벌거벗고 몸을 웅크린 채, 그녀는 거의 인간처럼 보이지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:810
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d861fab5:

    # "While I caught a glimpse of her tits and the brown bush nestled above her pussy, it was certainly not arousing by any means."
    "그녀의 가슴과 보지 위에 자리 잡은 갈색 음모를 얼핏 봤지만, 결코 흥분되는 광경은 아니었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:811
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_061bc36a:

    # "It was pitiful to see the pale shadow that remained of what was once a person, now reduced to that of a starving animal."
    "한때 사람이었던 것의 남아있는 창백한 그림자가, 이제 굶주린 짐승과 같은 모습으로 전락한 걸 보니 가련했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:812
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_0a68cb52:

    # "Both for her dignity and due to my own discomfort, I tore my eyes away."
    "그녀의 존엄을 위해서도, 내 불편함 때문에도, 나는 시선을 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:813
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c7f7f07b:

    # BORRAS "My lord... {i}What have they done to you?{/i}"
    BORRAS "\"맙소사... {i}대체 무슨 짓을 한 거지?{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:815
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_42312e84:

    # "Borras looked back to the main force of men and shouted out."
    "보라스가 뒤로 돌아서 주력 부대를 바라보며 소리쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:816
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1b4f0c8b:

    # BORRAS "WE HAVE A SURVIVOR!"
    BORRAS "\"생존자가 있다!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:817
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1688f5fb:

    # "He jumped down from his horse and quickly made his way over to the woman."
    "그는 말에서 뛰어내려 재빨리 그 여자에게로 다가갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:823
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c561bdb5:

    # MARKUS "Captain, wait! Shouldn’t one of—"
    MARKUS "\"대위님, 잠깐! 저희 중 한 명이—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:824
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_de947a00:

    # "Before Markus could even finish his sentence, Borras was crouched down in front of the woman, eye to eye with her like she was the only thing in the world."
    "마커스가 문장을 끝내기도 전에, 보라스가 여인 앞에 쪼그려 앉아, 마치 그녀가 세상에 유일한 존재인 양 눈을 맞추고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:825
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2660bfe:

    # BORRAS "Ma’am, are you alright? Are there any others?"
    BORRAS "\"부인, 괜찮으십니까? 다른 사람이 더 있습니까?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:827
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_85d73cc8:

    # "We looked behind us to see the Captain galloping towards us, dust and rocks flying out from beneath the thundering hooves of his horse."
    "우리는 뒤를 돌아보았고, 대위가 말의 우레 같은 발굽 아래에서 먼지와 돌이 튀어 오르며 우리를 향해 전속력으로 달려오는 걸 보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:828
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_44efba98:

    # DUPREY "GET AWAY FROM HER, YOU FOOLS!"
    DUPREY "\"저 여자에게서 떨어져, 이 바보들아!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:829
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef16b6ce:

    # "As Borras rested his hands on the woman’s shoulders, it was already too late."
    "보라스가 여인의 어깨에 손을 얹었을 때, 이미 너무 늦었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:837
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b08547c7:

    # "She stopped crying and the ground began to shake violently..."
    "그녀가 울음을 멈추고 땅이 격렬하게 흔들리기 시작했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:840
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e64ba56e:

    # "Her lifeless eyes rolled white as a huge, monstrous... thing dragged itself from inside of her."
    "그녀의 생기 없는 눈이 하얗게 뒤집히고 거대하고 기괴한... 무언가가 그녀의 안에서부터 기어 나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:841
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4b513b50:

    # "Scorpion like in appearance, with tentacles piercing its way through her orifices, it made the {i}dead{/i} woman scream."
    "전갈처럼 생겼고, 촉수들이 그녀의 구멍들을 뚫고 나왔으며, 그것은 {i}죽은{/i} 여자를 비명 지르게 만들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:843
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_556e580b:

    # "The beast was a colossus, tearing down what remained of the house it had hidden under it rose onto its six legs."
    "그 괴물은 거대했고, 숨어 있던 집의 잔해를 무너뜨리며 여섯 개의 다리로 일어섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:844
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4ab5169:

    # "It’s skin black and red, its eyes were glowing with malevolence, as it slavered in anticipation."
    "검붉은 피부에, 눈은 악의로 빛나고 있었고, 기대에 차서 침을 질질 흘렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:846
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_df99a23e:

    # KIARA "Get out of the way!"
    KIARA "\"비켜!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:847
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d2a55f19:

    # "Horrified, Borras froze in fear before he moved to grab his sword, but it was too late."
    "겁에 질린 보라스는 공포에 얼어붙었다가 검을 잡으려 움직였지만, 이미 너무 늦었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:853
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d262ef:

    # "A toxic acid spewed from the thing’s mouth, Borras tried to roll to dodge the blast but was quickly engulfed and left writhing in agony, animal like cries shuddering through him."
    "그것의 입에서 독성 산이 뿜어져 나왔다. 보라스는 폭발을 피하려 몸을 굴렸지만 금세 휩싸였고, 고통 속에 몸부림치며 동물 같은 비명이 그를 관통했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:854
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_2d77f11e:

    # "Desperately, he clawed at his own melting face before becoming deathly quiet, limply turning to face us one with only the sizzling sounds of the acid still dissolving through his bones."
    "필사적으로, 그는 자신의 녹아내리는 얼굴을 할퀴다가 죽음처럼 조용해졌고, 축 늘어져 우리를 향해 돌아섰다. 산성 물질이 아직도 뼈를 녹이는 지글거리는 소리만이 남아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:856
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f15fdca9:

    # "His eyes blinked in disbelief that he was about to die, with a trembling hand he tried to motion something with his sword."
    "그의 눈은 자신이 곧 죽을 거라는 걸 믿기지 않는다는 듯 깜빡였고, 떨리는 손으로 검으로 무언가 신호를 보내려 애썼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:857
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_716bc802:

    # "There was nothing but horror etched onto what was left of his face before he collapsed, raising the sword up as if he was going to plunge it into himself."
    "그의 얼굴에 남은 것에는 공포만이 새겨져 있었고, 그가 쓰러지기 전에 검을 들어 마치 자기 자신에게 찔러 넣으려는 듯이 치켜올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:858
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ad1aafe6:

    # "Instead, he planted it in the ground allowing it to take the weight of what we witnessed become his corpse, perhaps in a position he deemed more dignified than lying at the feet of the Demorai that killed him."
    "대신, 그는 그것을 땅에 꽂아 우리가 목격한 그의 시체가 된 것의 무게를 지탱하게 했다. 아마도 자신을 죽인 데모라이의 발치에 누워있는 것보다 더 품위 있다고 여긴 자세로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:867
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acc7c430:

    # DUPREY "ON ME!"
    DUPREY "\"나를 따르라!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:881
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1b3652e9:

    # "Exhausted and at our breaking point, we watched as the thing slumped over to its side, bloodied and taking staggered breaths."
    "지치고 한계에 다다른 우리는, 그 괴물이 옆으로 쓰러져 피투성이가 되고 숨을 헐떡이며 비틀거리는 걸 지켜봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:882
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a13bee82:

    # "Captain Duprey stormed towards it as it squirmed in agony, trying to drag itself away."
    "뒤프리 대위는 고통 속에 몸부림치며 기어서 달아나려는 그것을 향해 달려들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:883
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_87fa56d5:

    # "Swinging his axe down one last time onto the thing’s head, in one clean cut Duprey eviscerated its skull and pierced through to its brain."
    "마지막으로 도끼를 그 괴물의 머리에 휘둘러, 뒤프리는 깔끔한 일격으로 두개골을 절개하고 뇌까지 꿰뚫었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:887
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3fc9c07e:

    # "We all looked around in horror as we waited for what was to happen next, slowly the Captain turned to look at us with lifeless eyes."
    "우리 모두는 공포 속에서 주위를 둘러보며 다음에 무슨 일이 일어날지 기다렸다. 천천히 대위가 생기 없는 눈으로 우리를 향해 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:889
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7f8a03ed:

    # MARKUS "... C-Captain... It... It just...."
    MARKUS "\"... ㄷ-대위님... 그게... 그게 방금....\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:890
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8098a9e5:

    # DUPREY "... We’re nearly there. Come on...."
    DUPREY "\"... 거의 다 왔어. 가자....\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:891
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_118a43a1:

    # MARKUS "But we—"
    MARKUS "\"하지만 저희는—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:892
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4e07c4e9:

    # DUPREY "{i}Come. On.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"{i}가자.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:893
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fdb0e643:

    # "As Markus stared at Borras’ corpse, frozen in horror, the Captain put his hand almost tenderly on his shoulder."
    "마커스가 보라스의 시체를 공포에 질려 바라보자, 대장은 거의 다정하게 그의 어깨에 손을 얹었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:894
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b72d9ec2:

    # DUPREY "We keep moving, you understand?"
    DUPREY "\"계속 전진한다, 알겠나?\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:895
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_42029655:

    # "Markus nodded weakly."
    "마커스가 힘없이 고개를 끄덕였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:897
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acfa9909:

    # "Staggering towards his horse, the Captain clambered onto it and began to trot on ahead."
    "자신의 말을 향해 비틀거리며, 대위는 말 위로 기어올라 앞으로 느릿느릿 나아가기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:900
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e8141954:

    # "The men, horrified at what they had just witnessed, once again fell into place behind him."
    "방금 목격한 것에 겁에 질린 병사들은, 다시 한 번 그의 뒤로 대열을 맞췄다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:901
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fd3fd31f:

    # "By now, any optimism we had felt since our first small battle on the ridge was really and truly gone."
    "이제 능선에서의 첫 소규모 전투 이후 느꼈던 어떤 낙관도 진정으로, 완전히 사라져 버렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:902
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f3c22127:

    # "We had all been brutally reminded that out here, we were not the hunters, but the {i}hunted{/i}."
    "우리 모두는 이곳에서 우리가 사냥꾼이 아니라 {i}사냥감{/i}이라는 사실을 잔혹하게 상기시켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:912
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c21cf7c5:

    # "More than a week passed since Borras’ death."
    "보라스의 죽음 이후로 일주일 이상이 지났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:913
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7cd181f4:

    # "Days and days of travelling on mercilessly, Duprey pushing us harder and harder, fuelled by the death of his friend."
    "며칠이고 무자비하게 이어지는 여행. 뒤프리는 친구의 죽음에 연료를 얻은 듯 우리를 점점 더 혹독하게 몰아붙였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:914
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_48ad92c6:

    # "We found ourselves marching through the thick, seemingly endless forest, every snap of a twig set us on edge as we looked out for enemies that might be lurking."
    "우리는 울창하고 끝이 없어 보이는 숲속을 행군하고 있었다. 나뭇가지가 부러지는 소리 하나하나에 숨어 있을지 모를 적들을 경계하며 신경이 곤두섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:915
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d0ae3b:

    # "I’d never before felt so vulnerable whilst being surrounded by so many people."
    "이렇게 많은 사람들에게 둘러싸여 있으면서 이렇게 취약하다고 느껴본 적은 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:916
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2d2b968:

    # "I marvelled over how we’d proceeded so long on this journey, carelessly allowing ourselves the hope that we might just be alright."
    "나는 이 여정에서 우리가 어떻게 그렇게 오랫동안 나아갈 수 있었는지, 부주의하게도 우리가 그냥 괜찮을 거라는 희망을 품었는지 놀라워했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:917
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_af5902e0:

    # "Now I found my heart was always racing."
    "이제 나는 내 심장이 항상 빨리 뛰고 있다는 걸 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:918
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef9db5b9:

    # "I allowed the fear to wash over me every morning, I depended on it to keep me on edge."
    "나는 매일 아침 두려움이 나를 휩쓸도록 내버려두었다. 나를 긴장 상태로 유지하기 위해 그것에 의존했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:919
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ed8f2bdd:

    # "Sleep was nightmare after nightmare, I made sure that whenever I did manage to steal a few hours of rest that my sword was always within arm’s reach."
    "잠은 악몽의 연속이었다. 나는 몇 시간의 휴식을 훔쳐 낼 때마다 내 검이 항상 팔이 닿는 곳에 있도록 확실히 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:920
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_093c96fb:

    # "Finally, just as the rain began to hammer down onto the ground and dark grey clouds circled overhead, we arrived at the fort."
    "마침내, 비가 땅을 때리기 시작하고 짙은 회색 구름이 머리 위를 맴돌 때, 우리는 요새에 도착했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:924
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_85b5b56a:

    # "As we trudged our way inside the mud-soaked fort through what was left of the gate, we looked around at the dismal lifelessness of the place."
    "진흙투성이 요새 안으로 남은 문을 통해 터덜터덜 들어서자, 우리는 그 장소의 음울한 생기 없음을 둘러보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:926
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_88fc8c4d:

    # "There was no sign of anyone and there hadn’t been for a while."
    "사람의 흔적은 전혀 없었고, 한동안 그랬던 것 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:927
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_0aca1b04:

    # "Here and there were scattered the ruinous remains of the old buildings and overturned fruit carts."
    "여기저기엔 오래된 건물들의 폐허 잔해와 뒤집힌 과일 수레들이 흩어져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:929
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c976be39:

    # "Perhaps most prominently, and propped up by the various wooden frames, was a colossal tunnel that had been dug into the mountain itself."
    "아마도 가장 눈에 띄는 것은, 여러 목재 틀로 지탱된 채로, 산 자체를 뚫어 판 거대한 터널이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:930
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_079427da:

    # "Inside it was pitch black, but it was clear from the burned-out torches at the entrance that whoever had inhabited this place had spent a considerable amount of time in these tunnels."
    "안은 칠흑 같았지만, 입구의 다 타버린 횃불들로 보아 이곳에 살았던 누군가는 이 터널에서 상당한 시간을 보냈음이 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:931
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_6cf2b373:

    # "Captain Duprey looked around and then turned to us cautiously."
    "뒤프리 대위는 주위를 둘러보고는 조심스럽게 우리에게 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:936
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c7470f9d:

    # DUPREY "Right, on me, you lot."
    DUPREY "\"좋아, 내게 붙어, 너희들.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:942
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_bd175ca6:

    # "With freshly lit torches, we followed Captain Duprey deeper into the tunnel."
    "새로 불을 붙인 횃불을 들고, 우리는 뒤프리 대위를 따라 터널 깊숙이 들어갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:943
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3217bf80:

    # "It seemed to drag on endlessly, meandering up and down, delving deeper and deeper into the mountain."
    "끝없이 이어지는 듯했다. 위아래로 구불구불하며, 산 속으로 점점 더 깊이 파고들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:944
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e1df4315:

    # "We finally reached a formidable stone wall blocking our way, inscribed with strange markings I was not familiar with."
    "우리는 마침내 길을 막는 견고한 돌벽에 도달했는데, 거기에는 내가 알지 못하는 기묘한 표식들이 새겨져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:945
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_94a75c24:

    # "As the Captain gently touched his hand on its cold wet surface, the inscribed markings began to glow an ominous red and he stepped back, more cautious than I’d ever seen him."
    "대장이 차갑고 젖은 표면에 부드럽게 손을 대자, 새겨진 문양이 불길한 붉은 빛을 내기 시작했고 그는 뒤로 물러섰다, 내가 본 것 중 가장 조심스러운 모습으로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:947
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e411519c:

    # DUPREY "Hmm..."
    DUPREY "\"흠...\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:949
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e67c2c91:

    # "He looked back at the others and whistled."
    "그는 뒤를 돌아 다른 이들을 보고 휘파람을 불었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:950
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f242c681:

    # DUPREY "Get one of those mages down here now!"
    DUPREY "\"마법사 하나 당장 여기로 데려와!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:951
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1ef1e65a:

    # DUPREY "I’ll bet any one of you a keg of rum that what we’re looking for is behind here."
    DUPREY "\"내가 럼주 한 통 걸지. 우리가 찾는 게 이 뒤에 있을 거야.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:955
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_edba64a4:

    # "As a couple of the mages rushed forward, they frantically began to inspect the inscription, running their hands over it and muttering to themselves."
    "마법사 몇 명이 앞으로 달려가자, 그들은 열광적으로 비문을 조사하기 시작했고, 손을 대며 중얼거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:959
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c8092128:

    # MAGE "This may take us some time to open, Captain."
    MAGE "\"이걸 여는 데 시간이 좀 걸릴 것 같습니다, 대위님.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:960
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4f83352:

    # DUPREY "Hurry as quick as you can, I don’t like being caught in this forsaken place."
    DUPREY "\"가능한 한 빨리 서둘러. 이 저주받은 장소에 갇혀 있는 게 영 내키지 않아.\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:961
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3142b6d0:

    # DUPREY "MEN! TAKE POSITIONS ON THE FORT! SECURE THE AREA!"
    DUPREY "\"전원! 요새에 위치를 잡아라! 구역을 확보하라!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:965
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3f5bdf35:

    # "We leapt to attention at his order and made our way out once again into the fort."
    "우리는 그의 명령에 즉각 반응하여 다시 요새 밖으로 나갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:966
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_cc451534:

    # MC "(Wonder what’s behind that thing?)"
    MC "\"(저 뒤에 뭐가 있는 걸까?)\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:969
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a8bb7d00:

    # "The men moved to take positions around the remnants of the fort."
    "병사들이 요새의 잔해 주변에 위치를 잡기 위해 움직였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:970
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8aa761bc:

    # "Nervous, I went and asked for some supplies from the supply wagon."
    "긴장한 채, 나는 보급 마차에 가서 보급품을 좀 요청했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:974
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_734778e3:

    # "There was an eerie silence as we waited and watched impatiently, each of us wondering what had happened here, most of us too scared to voice our ideas."
    "우리가 참을성 없이 기다리며 지켜볼 때 섬뜩한 침묵이 흘렀다. 우리 각자는 여기서 무슨 일이 있었는지 궁금해했고, 대부분은 너무 두려워서 우리의 생각을 입 밖에 내지 못했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:975
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c03a767e:

    # "Painted on the face of every man and woman was the unease of the realisation that we were sitting ducks."
    "모든 남녀의 얼굴에는 우리가 앉아서 당하는 신세라는 깨달음의 불안이 그려져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:976
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_da552107:

    # "We could do nothing more than pray that the seal would open and we could collect whatever was behind it quickly and leave this haunted place in our memories."
