    # MARKUS "{i}*Huff* *Huff*{/i} They just... {i}*Huff*{/i} Keep coming!"
    MARKUS "\"{i}*헉* *헉*{/i} 놈들이 그냥... {i}*헉*{/i} 계속 몰려와!\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1219
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f77ba669:

    # MC "Come on! We’re almost there! The Captain is—"
    MC "\"어서! 거의 다 왔어! 대위님이—\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1223
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c36b3b40:

    # "There was a deafening roar that caused the ground itself to shudder, piercing through our very souls."
    "땅 자체를 뒤흔들고 우리 영혼을 꿰뚫는 귀청이 터질 듯한 포효가 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1224
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_da95269f:

    # "As we all watched on ahead in horror, the men who had clustered around the gate with their shields and swords were flung aside in one mighty thrust."
    "우리 모두가 공포에 질려 앞을 바라보는 가운데, 방패와 검으로 성문 주위에 모여 있던 남자들이 한 번의 강력한 찌르기에 옆으로 날아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1225
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_60a1befa:

    # "Dragging itself forward appeared a terrifying monstrosity unlike anything we had ever seen before."
    "앞으로 기어 나온 것은 우리가 지금까지 본 그 어떤 것과도 다른, 끔찍한 괴물이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1226
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_546fcc0b:

    # "Almost humanoid in its shape, it stood up on its two thick hind legs."
    "형태가 거의 인간형으로, 두껍고 두 개의 뒷다리로 일어섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1227
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_49485a0a:

    # "It’s feet and hands seemed more talon than anything else and its teeth were too large for a mouth which struggled to contain them."
    "그것의 발과 손은 발톱에 더 가까워 보였고, 이빨은 그것을 간신히 담고 있는 입에 비해 너무 컸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1228
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_911f3faa:

    # "Its wings blocked out what little light there was, forcing us to battle in the darkness it created."
    "그 날개는 얼마 안 되는 빛마저 차단해, 우리가 그것이 만든 어둠 속에서 싸우도록 강요했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1229
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ae877858:

    # "With horns on its head, and a tail thrashing behind it, the thing was so much more than a nightmare."
    "머리에 뿔이 있고, 꼬리가 뒤에서 휘둘러지며, 그 괴물은 악몽 그 이상이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1230
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_99643b26:

    # "Its flesh seemed coated in a thick bone-like armour."
    "그 살갗은 두꺼운 뼈 같은 갑옷으로 덮인 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1231
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_cf3de208:

    # "One Scout who tried to swing his sword in an effort to pierce the creature, quickly found his blade bouncing off before the monster crushed him with his hand into nothing more than a pile of blood and bones and sinew."
    "그 생명체를 찌르려고 검을 휘두르려던 한 정찰병은, 곧 자신의 검이 튕겨 나가는 걸 발견하고, 괴물이 그를 손으로 짓눌러 피와 뼈와 힘줄 더미로 만들어 버렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1233
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_eac06cb0:

    # DUPREY "You... {i}It’s you.{/i}"
    DUPREY "\"너... {i}너로구나.{/i}\""

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1235
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f09f5f97:

    # "In its hands, the monstrous being held a huge double ended spear of thick metal that pulsated dark energy."
    "그 손에는, 괴물 같은 존재가 어두운 에너지를 고동치는 두꺼운 금속의 거대한 양날 창을 쥐고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1236
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_25ac5a3d:

    # "It seemed as large as the trunk of a tree, towering five times over any man."
    "마치 나무 줄기만큼 커 보였고, 어떤 사람보다 다섯 배는 우뚝 솟아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1237
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c9542159:

    # "{i}... And it was heading right for us...{/i}"
    "{i}... 그리고 그게 우리를 향해 곧장 다가오고 있었어...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1238
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5189fafd:

    # "The Captain, bloodied and weary, looked towards us as he saw the thing heading our way."
    "피투성이가 되고 지친 대위는, 그 괴물이 우리 쪽으로 향하는 걸 보고 우리를 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1239
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0cc043e0:

    # "Duprey loudly cried out to grab its attention."
    "뒤프리가 그 괴물의 주의를 끌기 위해 크게 외쳤다."
# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-07-03 22:52

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1241
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1faa759c:

    # DUPREY "ZANARAK!"
    DUPREY "ZANARAK!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1242
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7805a38d:

    # "Hearing that name sent a shiver down my spine, I felt myself becoming increasingly delirious from all the fighting and bloodshed around me."
    "그 이름을 듣자 척추에 전율이 흘렀다. 주변에서 벌어지는 싸움과 유혈 난장 속에서 점점 정신이 혼미해져 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1243
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a006cbcf:

    # "It became hard to focus on the enormity of what was happening as that name sunk deep into the core of me, filling me with an icy terror."
    "그 이름이 내 심장 깊은 곳에 박히며 얼음 같은 공포로 나를 채우자, 벌어지고 있는 일의 엄청난 규모에 집중하는 것조차 어려워졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1244
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_625b466c:

    # "I felt that I might collapse at any moment as blackness crept into my vision."
    "시야에 어둠이 스며들며 언제 쓰러져도 이상하지 않을 것 같은 느낌이 들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1245
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_422d9dcd:

    # "I started to pray for it, thinking it would be a small mercy to give myself over to the darkness and escape the decimation around me."
    "차라리 어둠 속으로 나를 내던져 주변의 참화에서 벗어나는 게 작은 자비라도 될 거라 생각하며, 나는 그렇게 되기를 바라기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1246
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aef12e9d:

    # "But the adrenaline snapped me awake and forced me to watch as the two squared off."
    "하지만 아드레날린이 나를 깨웠고, 둘이 서로 맞서는 광경을 지켜볼 수밖에 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1247
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_30c39a8f:

    # "The thing glared at him, hatred spewing from its eyes as it became clear the monstrous bogeyman of our childhood {i}recognised him.{/i}"
    "그것은 그를 노려보았다. 어린 시절 우리를 공포에 떨게 했던 그 흉측한 괴물이 {i}그를 알아보고{/i} 있다는 게 분명해지면서, 눈에서는 증오가 뿜어져 나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1248
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5b38abb9:

    # DUPREY "{i}After all these years...{/i} Again we face each other!"
    DUPREY "{i}이 모든 세월이 지나고...{/i} 우리 다시 마주하는구나!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1250
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9f3b7d0e:

    # DUPREY "Aye, beasty! So, you DO recognise me!"
    DUPREY "그래, 이 짐승아! 그래도 나를 알아보는구나!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1251
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e5950610:

    # DUPREY " I knew there was a brain behind that thick fucking skull of yours!"
    DUPREY "그 빌어먹을 두꺼운 대가리 속에도 뇌라는 게 있다는 걸 알고 있었어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1252
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7d377b6d:

    # "Zanarak turned menacingly towards Captain Duprey, giving him its full attention."
    "자나락은 위협적으로 듀프리 대위를 향해 돌아서며 모든 주의를 그에게 집중했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1253
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ddeb9dfe:

    # DUPREY "Come on then, you fuck! LET'S SEE YOU TRY TO FUCKING KILL ME!"
    DUPREY "덤벼라, 이 개자식아! 어디 한번 날 죽여 봐라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1254
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_1c9a8a91:

    # DUPREY "For Newheart! FOR ALDERAYYYYY!"
    DUPREY "뉴하트를 위하여! 앨더레이를 위하아아아아아아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1255
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_309bf98b:

    # "Lunging forward, the Captain flung himself screaming at the beast, dodging one of Zanarak’s swipes as he brought his mighty axe down on him, slashing at the beast’s ribs with all his strength."
    "앞으로 돌진하며, 대위는 고함을 지르며 짐승에게 몸을 날렸다. 자나락의 일격 하나를 피하면서 강력한 도끼를 그대로 내리꽂아, 전력을 다해 짐승의 갈비뼈를 후려쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1256
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c5ac5daf:

    # "Zanarak staggered, the blade had bounced off his flesh and failed to cut him, but it must have hurt."
    "자나락이 비틀거렸다. 칼날은 그의 살갗에 튕겨 나가 상처를 입히지 못했지만, 충격은 분명히 있었을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1257
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2f8ae10d:

    # "The Captain once again moved to dodge Zanarak’s swishing tail as it smashed into one of the walls, flinging everything still climbing them to the mud and blood beneath."
    "대위는 다시 한번 자나락의 휘몰아치는 꼬리를 피했다. 꼬리가 벽 하나를 강타하며, 거기에 매달려 있던 모든 것들을 아래의 진흙과 피 속으로 내던졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1258
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef64d10d:

    # "Once again lunging forward, Captain Duprey rolled forward to evade the sweeping swing of Zanarak’s spear and leapt up to attack, smashing Zanarak’s face with his axe, causing him to drop the spear."
    "다시 한번 앞으로 돌진한 듀프리 대위는 자나락의 창이 휩쓰는 것을 굴러서 피한 뒤 뛰어올라 공격했다. 도끼로 자나락의 얼굴을 강타하자, 그 충격에 창을 떨어뜨렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1259
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_be32a2be:

    # KIARA "Why doesn’t his axe pierce its flesh?!"
    KIARA "왜 그의 도끼가 살을 뚫지 못하는 거지?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1260
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1e2cdd8:

    # MC "I don’t know! It’s hide must be too thick!"
    MC "나도 몰라! 가죽이 너무 두꺼운 게 틀림없어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1261
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8d41be99:

    # "While it staggered, the Captain once again continued a fury of heavy hits, causing Zanarak to fumble backwards, blood dripping down his face from where the axe had managed to pierce through his hard skin."
    "비틀거리는 동안에도 대위는 계속해서 맹렬한 공격을 퍼부었다. 자나락은 뒤로 밀려나며 비틀거렸고, 도끼가 단단한 가죽을 뚫은 자리에서 피가 얼굴 아래로 흘러내렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1262
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_906e6a5f:

    # "For a moment, it felt like victory was at hand, that the Captain would overcome Zanarak and save the day."
    "잠시나마 승리가 손에 잡힐 듯한 느낌이 들었다. 대위가 자나락을 제압하고 상황을 구해낼 것만 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1263
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_16ea6760:

    # DUPREY "Come on! Is that all you've—"
    DUPREY "덤비! 그게 다냐—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1264
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d0d64118:

    # "Suddenly, Zanarak charged forward with such speed, he caught the Captain off guard. With one backhand of his claw, he sent the Captain tumbling into the mud."
    "갑자기, 자나락은 대위가 미처 반응할 수 없을 만큼 빠른 속도로 돌진했다. 발톱으로 한 번 후려치자, 대위는 진흙탕으로 나뒹굴었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1265
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_721e4ea2:

    # "Coughing and retching up blood, he moved to grab his axe once again but before he could, Zanarak was on him, knocking the axe away with his foot as he grabbed Captain Duprey with both hands."
    "피를 기침하며 헛구역질하면서, 그는 다시 도끼를 잡으려 했지만 미처 손이 닿기도 전에 자나락이 덮쳤다. 발로 도끼를 걷어차 버리고는 두 손으로 듀프리 대위를 붙잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1266
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7a8fc89:

    # "Frantically, we continued to fight our way forward through the hordes of Demorai, but were powerless to save him, we could only watch... {i}and despair.{/i}"
    "필사적으로 우리는 데모라이 무리를 뚫고 앞으로 나아가려 싸웠지만, 그를 구할 힘은 없었다. 우리가 할 수 있는 거라곤 지켜보는 것뿐... {i}그리고 절망하는 것뿐.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1267
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_70a61346:

    # "As Zanarak squeezed the Captain’s body in its claws, there was a terrible snapping and screeching sound as the Captain retched blood out his mouth."
    "자나락이 발톱으로 대위의 몸을 쥐어짜자, 끔찍한 뼈 부러지는 소리와 비명 섞인 소리가 울렸고, 대위는 입에서 피를 쏟아냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1268
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aab6a330:

    # "Zanarak’s tongue licked its lips in anticipation as a cruel smile crawled across its face. It brought the Captain closer, quivering with excitement."
    "자나락의 혀는 기대감에 입술을 핥았고, 잔혹한 미소가 얼굴에 번졌다. 그는 대위를 더 가까이 끌어당기며 흥분으로 몸을 떨었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1269
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b28e6f0b:

    # DUPREY "{i}Fucking... choke on me...{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}빌어먹을... 삼켜라, 날...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1270
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b41bcfd6:

    # DUPREY "{i}YOU CUNT!{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}이 씨발놈아!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1271
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7d68f31c:

    # "In one last effort of defiance, the Captain swung his head forward to smash his forehead against Zanarak, causing his own head to bleed in the process as he spat his blood onto Zanarak’s darkly bemused face."
    "마지막 저항의 일격으로, 대위는 고개를 앞으로 휘둘러 자나락의 얼굴에 이마를 박았다. 그 과정에서 자신의 머리에서도 피가 흘렀고, 짙은 어둠 속에서 희미한 미소를 띤 자나락의 얼굴에 피를 뱉었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1274
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_47940fd0:

    # "Zanarak, in return, snarled angrily as he crushed the Captain in his powerful taloned hands."
    "자나락은 이에 화가 난 듯 으르렁거리며 강력한 발톱 달린 손으로 대위를 으스러뜨렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1276
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69683e08:

    # "Duprey’s agonising scream almost seemed to satiate him before he plunged his jaw forward and greedily tore him apart in a bloody, violent mess."
    "듀프리의 고통스러운 비명이 그를 만족시키기라도 한 듯, 이내 턱을 앞으로 들이밀어 탐욕스럽게 그를 피비린내 나는 난폭한 난장판 속에서 갈기갈기 찢어버렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1282
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_64f442b9:

    # "Distantly, I felt Markus’ hand on my shoulder pull me back as the world around me became quiet as a graveyard."
    "희미하게, 마르쿠스의 손이 내 어깨를 뒤로 잡아끄는 게 느껴졌다. 주변 세상은 마치 묘지처럼 조용해졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1283
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_9a29d94f:

    # "When he spoke, I couldn’t quite hear what he was saying until he shook me violently and sound all seemed to rush back at once."
    "그가 무슨 말을 하는지 잘 들리지 않았다. 그가 나를 거칠게 흔들자, 모든 소리가 한꺼번에 몰려왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1290
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c370ce71:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]! We need to get out of here now!"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]! 당장 여기서 빠져나가야 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1291
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4bbe56ad:

    # "Shaking my head fearfully, I turned towards Kiara."
    "두려움에 떨며 고개를 저은 나는 키아라를 향해 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1293
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_e7d23a00:

    # MC "We have to go!"
    MC "가야 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1294
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2ead6772:

    # "As Kiara battled off some of the Demorai and turned to face me, she suddenly stopped in her tracks with a shudder."
    "키아라가 데모라이 몇몇을 상대하며 나를 향해 돌아서다가, 갑자기 몸을 떨며 그 자리에 멈춰 섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1303
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5c962eab:

    # "Peering down in an almost comical confusion she noticed what we all saw happen; a tentacle had thrust its way through Kiara’s chest."
    "거의 우스꽝스러울 정도로 혼란스러운 표정으로 아래를 내려다보던 그녀는, 우리 모두가 목격한 광경을 확인했다. 촉수 하나가 키아라의 가슴을 꿰뚫고 있었던 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1304
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8942250d:

    # "I looked at her, and she me, paralysed with terror."
    "나는 그녀를 바라봤고, 그녀도 나를 바라봤다. 공포에 얼어붙은 채로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1305
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_6e5b7aa8:

    # "With a trail of blood seeping from the side of her mouth, she simply said..."
    "입가에서 피가 한 줄기 흘러내리며, 그녀는 그저 이렇게 말했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1306
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_af03a4be:

    # KIARA "{i}Run...{/i}"
    KIARA "{i}달려...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1307
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4de9edf4:

    # "And with that Kiara was flung backwards into the throes of battle."
    "그리고 그 말과 함께 키아라는 전투의 한복판으로 뒤로 내던져졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1309
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_b1bef907:

    # "Feeling a surge of manic grief, I screamed as I tried to fling myself forward to save her, but Markus used all his strength and held me back."
    "광적인 슬픔이 치밀어 올라, 나는 그녀를 구하려고 몸을 던지려 했지만, 마르쿠스가 온 힘을 다해 나를 붙잡았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1310
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_61978aa7:

    # MARKUS "IT’S TOO LATE, SHE’S GONE!"
    MARKUS "너무 늦었어, 그녀는 갔어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1311
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f4e00510:

    # "Determinedly pulling me back, Markus cried..."
    "단호하게 나를 뒤로 끌어당기며, 마르쿠스가 외쳤다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1312
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0da52be2:

    # MARKUS "The battle is lost! We have to retreat!"
    MARKUS "전투에서 졌어! 후퇴해야 해!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1313
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_cf98d2a8:

    # MC "We’re surrounded!"
    MC "우리 포위됐어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1314
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_8baa2c55:

    # "Markus looked around wildly, staring back at the entrance to the cavern and pulled me along."
    "마르쿠스는 미친 듯이 주변을 둘러보더니, 동굴 입구를 응시하며 나를 끌고 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1315
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_363568e5:

    # MARKUS "Come on! It’s the only way!"
    MARKUS "어서! 이게 유일한 방법이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1321
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_4170c645:

    # MC "HURRY!"
    MC "서둘러!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1322
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7ad62c8c:

    # MARKUS "It won’t close!"
    MARKUS "안 닫혀!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1323
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d7589ccf:

    # MC "CLOSE IT! CLOSE THE FUCKING DOOR!"
    MC "닫아! 그 빌어먹을 문 닫으라고!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1324
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_ef27cd89:

    # MARKUS "I’m trying!"
    MARKUS "하고 있어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1325
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_2cd10d35:

    # MC "MARKUS! HURRY! IT’S NEARLY—"
    MC "마커스! 서둘러! 거의 다—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1335
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_f00dab72:

    # "Exhausted, caked in dirt and grime, me and Markus looked at each other wearily."
    "지치고 흙먼지로 뒤덮인 채, 나와 마르쿠스는 서로를 피곤한 눈으로 바라봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1336
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_60add535:

    # "The sounds of fighting outside had slowly died down, only an eerie silence was left."
    "바깥의 전투 소리는 서서히 잦아들고, 오싹한 정적만이 남았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1337
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_fe368176:

    # "We found ourselves speaking in whispers."
    "우리는 자신도 모르게 속삭이며 대화하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1338
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_c55369df:

    # MARKUS "Are we...?"
    MARKUS "우리...?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1339
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_aa0d9848:

    # MC "{i}We’re the only ones left.{/i}"
    MC "{i}우리만 남았어.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1340
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_69308a51:

    # "The dawning realisation caused the blood to run cold in our veins, slowly we turned to look around at what may be our tomb."
    "그 깨달음이 찾아오자 핏속의 피가 차갑게 식어갔다. 천천히, 우리는 우리의 무덤이 될지도 모를 이 곳을 둘러보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1341
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_adf58131:

    # "The chamber was unusual."
    "그 방은 평범하지 않았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1342
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_a845dd1f:

    # "Two strange obelisks stood menacingly in the center of the room."
    "두 개의 기이한 오벨리스크가 방 중앙에 위협적으로 서 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1347
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f07395e:

    # "One of the perfect pair black, the other white, they looked timeless, ancient."
    "완벽한 한 쌍 중 하나는 검은색, 다른 하나는 흰색. 그것들은 영원한 시간 속에서도 변치 않을 듯한, 고대의 느낌을 풍겼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1348
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_3e4b9aee:

    # MC "What are those?..."
    MC "저건 뭐지?..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1350
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_d6fd9fd7:

    # "Reluctantly shifting my gaze to examine the room, I saw tables full of vials and half empty potions."
    "마지못해 시선을 돌려 방을 살펴보니, 유리병과 반쯤 비워진 물약들이 가득한 테이블이 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1351
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_380c3d56:

    # "Various pieces of paper were scattered around the floor — someone had left in a hurry."
    "여러 장의 종이 조각들이 바닥에 흩어져 있었다 — 누군가 급히 떠난 게 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1352
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_180b3c82:

    # MARKUS "What is this place?"
    MARKUS "여기가 어디지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1353
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_0b01172f:

    # MC "I can’t even guess..."
    MC "짐작조차 안 돼..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1354
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_7f34c1ab:

    # MC "There has to be a way out of here though so, let’s see if we can find some kind of secret exit or something..."
    MC "하지만 여기서 나갈 길이 있을 거야, 비밀 출구 같은 걸 찾을 수 있는지 한번 보자..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1356
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_GateIsOpen_5e963aa5:

    # MARKUS "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Well, it sure beats waiting around to die..."
    MARKUS "{i}*한숨*{/i} 뭐, 죽을 때까지 기다리는 것보단 낫지..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1365
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_1490ecb4:

    # "Picking up some of the papers, I tried to piece them together and decipher some of what was going on."
    "종이 몇 장을 집어 들고, 나는 조각들을 맞춰 무슨 일인지 해독해 보려 애썼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1366
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_a36fbb89:

    # "{i}‘Subjects remain in petrified state until we can discover a means to try quelling their ‘parasitic’ natures.{/i}"
    "{i}‘피험체들은 그 ‘기생적’ 본성을 억제할 방법을 찾을 때까지 석화 상태를 유지하고 있다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1367
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3778fff4:

    # "{i}Neither Kern, Luxma, Burning Wings or Scun seem to have any chemical impact on ‘controlling’ them.’{/i}"
    "{i}‘컨, 룩스마, 버닝 윙즈, 스컨 중 어느 것도 그것들을 ‘통제’하는 데 화학적 영향을 미치지 못하는 것으로 보인다.’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1368
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_b2aa7c93:

    # "Hastily scribbled on the bottom was..."
    "아래쪽에 급하게 휘갈겨 쓴 글은..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1369
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_68192352:

    # "{i}‘All other current botanic ingredients local to Alderay have proven ineffective, requesting more ‘exotic’ ingredients to test with from neighbouring kingdoms.’{/i}"
    "{i}‘앨더레이에서 구할 수 있는 그 외의 식물성 재료는 모두 효과가 없는 것으로 입증되었으니, 인근 왕국에서 더 ‘이국적인’ 재료를 시험용으로 들여올 것을 요청한다.’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1370
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_3ead958e:

    # "{i}‘Just what will it take to get these things under control?’{/i}"
    "{i}‘도대체 이 녀석들을 통제하려면 무엇이 필요한 걸까?’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1371
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPapers_ea56ab57:

    # MC "(What are they talking about?)"
    MC "(무슨 얘기를 하는 거지?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1378
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_fe8092c0:

    # "Slumped down dead against the wall, still in his dark dusty robes, was the body of a Dark Mage clutching at some letter in his hands."
    "어둡고 먼지 쌓인 로브를 입은 채, 벽에 기대어 죽어 쓰러져 있는 것은 어떤 편지를 손에 움켜쥔 어둠의 마법사의 시체였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1379
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_737d8344:

    # MARKUS "What’s a Dark Mage doing here?"
    MARKUS "어둠의 마법사가 여기서 뭘 하는 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1380
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_ecae0ae1:

    # MC "I don’t know..."
    MC "나도 몰라..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1381
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_8143ea13:

    # "Reaching down, I pulled the crumpled letter from the skeleton hands of the Dark Mage."
    "손을 내밀어, 나는 어둠의 마법사의 뼈만 남은 손에서 구겨진 편지를 꺼냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1382
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_1c0d9374:

    # "As I did so, some the skeleton's bones disintegrated into ash right before my eyes."
    "그러자, 뼈 일부가 내 눈앞에서 재로 부서져 내렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1383
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_aeb74839:

    # "‘Consider this my final gift unto you, {i}my lord{/i}, I die safe in the knowledge that once you retrieve these things, you will finally turn the tide of this war...’"
    "‘이것을 나의 마지막 선물로 바치나이다, {i}나의 군주여{/i}, 이것들을 회수하시면 마침내 이 전쟁의 흐름을 뒤바꾸실 수 있으리라는 믿음 속에 저는 편히 죽음을 맞이합니다...’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1384
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_56e8ecef:

    # "‘But be wary, their power is still highly unstable... Choose only the finest to wield them, for to choose any less would spell {i}disaster{/i} for the realm.’"
    "‘하지만 조심하소서, 그 힘은 아직도 크게 불안정하니...가장 뛰어난 자들만을 골라 그 힘을 다루게 하소서, 그 이하의 자를 고르는 것은 왕국에 {i}재앙{/i}을 불러올 것이옵니다.’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1385
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_b633e548:

    # "‘Yours faithfully, forever, Kharlof.’"
    "‘영원히 충성을 다해, 칼로프 올림.’"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1386
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomSkeleton_a28c417d:

    # MC "(My lord? Turning the tide of the war? What is he talking about?)"
    MC "(군주라고? 전쟁의 흐름을 뒤바꾼다고? 무슨 말을 하는 거야?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1393
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_82c068b8:

    # "Inspecting the dust covered tables of potions, I tried reading the dozens of labels on each of the various jars and vials but recognized almost none of the ingredients."
    "먼지 쌓인 물약 테이블을 살펴보며, 나는 여러 병과 유리병에 붙은 수십 개의 라벨을 읽어보려 했지만 성분 대부분을 거의 알아볼 수 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1394
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_03c042eb:

    # MC "What is all this for?"
    MC "이게 다 뭐지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1396
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_27c7f643:

    # "Markus glanced over the potions and picked one up:"
    "마르쿠스는 물약들을 훑어보더니 하나를 집어 들었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1397
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomPotions_9c69b8c3:

    # MARKUS "They were certainly working hard to solve... {i}something{/i}."
    MARKUS "분명히 뭔가를... {i}해결하려고{/i} 열심히 일했던 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1403
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8c77d8f3:

    # "Apprehensively, the two of us finally made our way over to the obelisks."
    "두려움에 떨며, 우리 둘은 마침내 오벨리스크 쪽으로 다가갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1404
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c0f14f6:

    # "As I listened closely, I could almost hear a... {i}a heartbeat?{/i}"
    "자세히 귀를 기울이니, 거의... {i}심장 박동 소리?{/i} 같은 게 들리는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1405
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6256818a:

    # MARKUS "What are these things?"
    MARKUS "이것들은 뭐지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1406
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cac275a:

    # "Feeling a gnawing urge to reach out and touch the monument, I rested my hand on its ice-cold surface."
    "기념비에 손을 뻗고 싶은 강렬한 충동을 느끼며, 나는 얼음처럼 차가운 그 표면에 손을 올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1408
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f151046e:

    # "I’ve noticed Markus doing the same..."
    "마르쿠스도 똑같이 하고 있는 걸 알아챘다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1409
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a1e080a:

    # "This alone frightened me, and with a shudder I withdrew my hand just as fast."
    "그 사실만으로도 나는 두려워졌고, 전율과 함께 재빨리 손을 거두었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1410
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c246b715:

    # "Markus looked at me, pulling his hand back as well."
    "마르쿠스도 나를 보며 손을 거두었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1411
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_864bdbb5:

    # MARKUS "You okay?"
    MARKUS "괜찮아?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1412
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_81175200:

    # MC "This is weird, I thought—"
    MC "이상해, 내 생각엔—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1416
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8505186f:

    # "Suddenly, both monuments began to illuminate with colorful markings..."
    "갑자기, 두 기념비 모두에서 형형색색의 문양이 빛나기 시작했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1417
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_63884bfb:

    # "We stepped back fearfully, holding out our swords and mustering the remainders of our strength, naively hoping to protect ourselves from whatever dark magic these stones were channeling."
    "우리는 두려움에 뒷걸음질 치며 검을 앞으로 내밀고 남은 힘을 쥐어짜냈다. 이 돌들이 발산하는 어떤 어둠의 마법으로부터 순진하게도 스스로를 지키려는 심산이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1418
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b13f2d6c:

    # MARKUS "Why did you touch it?!"
    MARKUS "왜 만진 거야?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1419
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7f1d5238:

    # MC "I don’t know! I felt I had to—"
    MC "나도 몰라! 그냥 해야만 할 것 같았어—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1423
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5df8b429:

    # "{b}A black mass of slithering tentacles{/b} erupted from the monument I fixed my gaze upon."
    "{b}꿈틀거리는 검은 촉수 덩어리{/b}가 내 시선이 고정된 기념비에서 분출했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1424
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ff3e97c:

    # "Shocked, I instinctively tried to swing my sword at it, only to find my arm firmly locked in place, one of the squirmy limbs coiling tightly around it."
    "충격에 빠져 본능적으로 검을 휘두르려 했지만, 내 팔은 단단히 고정된 채 움직이지 않았다. 꿈틀거리는 촉수 하나가 팔을 빈틈없이 조이고 있었기 때문이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1425
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64fdced3:

    # "In an instant, I was engulfed by the dark entity."
    "순식간에, 나는 어둠의 존재에게 삼켜졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1426
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1c5eec72:

    # "Unable to fight it I broke into a desperate struggle, primordial terror clawing its way into my very soul."
    "맞서 싸울 수도 없었다. 나는 필사적으로 발버둥 쳤고, 태초의 공포가 내 영혼 깊숙이 발톱을 박아 넣었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1428
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31afbfe4:

    # "The last thing I saw was Markus, devoured by a similar abomination bursting out from the second monument..."
    "내가 마지막으로 본 것은 마르쿠스였다. 두 번째 기념비에서 터져 나온 비슷한 흉물에게 삼켜지는 모습..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1429
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6ea3e288:

    # "...only of {i}pure white{/i}."
    "...단지 {i}순백색{/i}의 그것이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1441
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b5509755:

    # "Dark dreams circled in my head..."
    "머릿속을 어두운 꿈들이 맴돌았다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1442
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c2ef21b2:

    # "...visions of hundreds of naked women of all the different races I had never seen..."
    "...내가 본 적 없는 온갖 종족의 수백 명의 나체 여인들이 보이는 환영..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1443
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ac79c46e:

    # "...fawning over me desperately, moaning in intense pleasure as I sat on what seemed like a golden throne..."
    "...황금 왕좌에 앉은 나에게 필사적으로 아양을 떨며, 격렬한 쾌락에 신음하는 모습..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1444
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_15801940:

    # "...storm clouds gathering overhead as lightning forked to the world below..."
    "...머리 위로 폭풍 구름이 몰려오고, 번개가 아래 세상을 향해 갈라지는 광경..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1459
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ebda109:

    # "My eyes shot open as I sat bolt upright in horror."
    "눈이 번쩍 뜨이며 나는 공포에 질려 상체를 곧추세웠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1460
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c8ca8afa:

    # "Drenched in sweat, I looked around frantically to get some sense of bearing on where I was."
    "땀에 흠뻑 젖은 채, 나는 미친 듯이 주변을 둘러보며 내가 어디 있는지 가늠해 보려 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1461
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5f8b107a:

    # "I was sitting on one of many rows of beds made up in a stone-cold room."
    "나는 돌처럼 차가운 방 안에 여러 줄로 늘어선 침대 중 하나에 앉아 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1463
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_af2e3de3:

    # "Looking around I realised I was in... {i}Fort Sebastian?{/i}"
    "주변을 둘러보니 나는... {i}세바스찬 요새?{/i}에 있다는 걸 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1464
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_06f0eaca:

    # "{i}The medical ward{/i}?"
    "{i}의무실{/i}인가?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1465
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_be4d18bb:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1467
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cd3553f:

    # "I turned my head to look to my side, Markus was leaning on the wall near the next bed, looking even paler than usual, his eyes dark and foreboding."
    "고개를 돌려 옆을 보니, 마르쿠스가 옆 침대 근처 벽에 기대고 있었다. 평소보다 더 창백해 보였고, 눈은 어둡고 불길해 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1468
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5aaca9bd:

    # "One would think he was on death’s door as he spoke to me."
    "그가 내게 말을 건네는 모습은 마치 죽음의 문턱에 서 있는 사람 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1469
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dfd2fec5:

    # MC "How did we... {i}get here?{/i}"
    MC "우리 어떻게... {i}여기 온 거야?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1470
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3feec716:

    # MARKUS "I don’t know... The nurses told me..."
    MARKUS "나도 몰라... 간호사들이 그러는데..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1471
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2fb985d3:

    # MARKUS "They found us naked outside the gates."
    MARKUS "성문 밖에서 우리를 발가벗은 채로 발견했대."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1472
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_077ab260:

    # MC "The gates? Are we—"
    MC "성문? 우리—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1473
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64a2f0c8:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... We’re home."
    MARKUS "응... 우리 집이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1474
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_87b6f681:

    # "Despite my mind being awash with questions, I could at least allow a deep sigh of relief that we had by some miracle survived {i}the horrors of that abandoned fort{/i}."
    "머릿속이 온통 의문투성이였지만, 기적적으로 {i}그 버려진 요새의 공포{/i}에서 살아남았다는 안도감에 깊은 한숨을 내쉴 수는 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1475
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b98f3a0:

    # "My mind turned to Captain Duprey, Borras... {i}Kiara...{/i}"
    "머릿속에는 듀프리 대위, 보라스... {i}키아라...{/i}가 떠올랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1476
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92d4e80e:

    # "I heard a clanking sound approaching and looked towards it."
    "철컥거리는 소리가 다가오는 게 들려 그쪽을 바라봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1477
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_05f226df:

    # "A huge figure walked towards us, accompanied by four heavily armed guards and a beautiful mage."
    "거대한 형체가 우리 쪽으로 걸어왔다. 중무장한 네 명의 호위병과 아름다운 마법사 한 명이 동행하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1479
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ff991c7:

    # "Naturally, the mage caught my wandering gaze, but just as I managed to focus a familiar, menacing voice opened up..."
    "당연히도, 마법사가 내 방황하는 시선을 사로잡았다. 하지만 겨우 초점을 맞추려는 순간, 익숙하고 위협적인 목소리가 들려왔다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1481
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_68fb8823:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Check them both."
    MENACING_VOICE "둘 다 확인해 봐."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1482
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_665817ca:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Of course, my lord."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "물론입니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1484
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4dbe0bba:

    # "As the mage stepped forward, I could not help but stare at her chest, deep cutout of her robes displaying a fair portion of her breasts."
    "마법사가 앞으로 나오자, 나는 그녀의 가슴에서 눈을 뗄 수 없었다. 로브의 깊게 파인 부분이 그녀의 풍만한 가슴의 상당 부분을 드러내고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1485
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5a9888e7:

    # "My heartbeat rose, an unnatural wave of passion caressing my weakened body..."
    "심장 박동이 빨라졌다. 부자연스러운 욕망의 물결이 내 약해진 몸을 어루만졌다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1486
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f72558e8:

    # "She spoke in a soft, raspy voice, pointing her staff at me:"
    "그녀가 부드럽고 쉰 목소리로 지팡이를 나에게 향하며 말했다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1487
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e803c89:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Hold still."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "가만히 계세요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1493
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32a24889:

    # "Her staff lit up, warm light following its cryptic tip as she slowly held it over my body, head to toe."
    "그녀의 지팡이가 빛나며, 신비로운 끝부분을 따라 따뜻한 빛이 흘렀다. 그녀는 천천히 지팡이를 내 몸 위로, 머리부터 발끝까지 훑었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1494
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4bb5c70:

    # "Markus was next, the procedure seemingly soothing his aching psyche."
    "다음은 마르쿠스였다. 그 의식은 그의 아픈 정신을 달래주는 듯 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1495
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_324b2179:

    # "In a few moments the mage was through examining us."
    "잠시 후 마법사는 우리 진찰을 끝냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1498
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bbae3533:

    # "Her full, purple lips let out a conclusive mutter, then she spoke up:"
    "그녀의 도톰한 보라색 입술이 결론을 내리듯 중얼거리더니, 이내 입을 열었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1499
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9d14bd22:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "They do not possess magic, nor do they reek of any magical essence that shows they have been possessed or tainted by the Demorai’ magic."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "마법을 지니고 있지 않으며, 데모라이의 마법에 사로잡혔거나 오염되었다는 마법의 흔적도 전혀 없습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1501
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8e787395:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Thank you, Kylisa, you may go now."
    MENACING_VOICE "고맙네, 카일리사, 이제 가도 좋네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1503
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31cce257:

    # "Kylisa bowed, as she stepped away and left the ward."
    "카일리사는 고개를 숙이고 물러나 병실을 떠났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1505
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5c00a2f0:

    # "Emperor Alcott’s attention was fully diverted to us now."
    "이제 알코트 황제의 관심은 온전히 우리에게 쏠렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1506
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32ac97cc:

    # ALCOTT "It is good to see you awake."
    ALCOTT "깨어나서 다행이군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1507
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dacb22da:

    # ALCOTT "Now then, it’s time you boys told me what the hell happened out there."
    ALCOTT "자, 이제 거기서 대체 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 보게."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1508
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c28cd0c:

    # "Clearly still deranged, I questioned if I was still dreaming..."
    "아직도 분명히 정신이 혼미한 상태에서, 나는 이게 여전히 꿈이 아닌가 의심했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1509
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efd13d1e:

    # "...or was it indeed Emperor Alcott himself, standing before me and Markus, giving a damn about what we’ve got to say."
    "...아니면 정말로 알코트 황제 본인이 나와 마르쿠스 앞에 서서, 우리 말에 신경이나 쓰고 있는 건지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1510
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7daffe81:

    # ALCOTT "... You two deaf?"
    ALCOTT "... 둘 다 귀 먹었나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1511
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1e27a783:

    # "I did my best to muster an answer."
    "나는 최선을 다해 대답을 짜내려 애썼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1512
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_031d7429:

    # MC "I... My lord... I..."
    MC "저... 각하... 저..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1513
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_82c15c63:

    # ALCOTT "Out with it!"
    ALCOTT "말해 보게!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1514
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_74abaf0e:

    # MC "We reached the fort as instructed, my lord."
    MC "명령대로 요새에 도착했습니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1515
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_182d39fe:

    # MC "It was abandoned, but we were hit by a huge Demorai force."
    MC "요새는 버려져 있었지만, 대규모 데모라이 병력에게 기습당했습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1516
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ef36cc08:

    # ALCOTT "How many?"
    ALCOTT "얼마나 되나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1517
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0898c1cf:

    # MC "I don’t know, sir... Hundreds... maybe thousands..."
    MC "잘 모르겠습니다, 각하... 수백... 아니 수천은 됐을 겁니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1518
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a4e4ae45:

    # ALCOTT "...Hmm..."
    ALCOTT "...Hmm..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1519
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b3696be1:

    # MC "... {i}That thing{/i}... it killed Captain Duprey."
    MC "... {i}그것{/i}이... 듀프리 대위님을 죽였습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1520
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1bddb1d5:

    # ALCOTT "Who? What thing? What are you talking about?"
    ALCOTT "누구? 무슨 것? 무슨 소리를 하는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1521
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b21ba69a:

    # MC "Demorai... Captain Duprey called it {i}Zanarak.{/i} It was there..."
    MC "데모라이... 듀프리 대위님은 {i}자나락{/i}이라고 불렀습니다. 거기 있었어요..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1522
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_618237ff:

    # "For just a moment, the Emperor’s stoic face cracked as he heard those words, even his armed guards turned to glance at each other, the scent of fear now hanging in the air."
    "잠시나마, 황제의 무표정한 얼굴이 그 말에 금이 갔다. 중무장한 호위병들조차 서로를 슬쩍 바라보았고, 공기 중에 두려움의 기운이 감돌았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1523
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c69602a0:

    # ALCOTT "I see..."
    ALCOTT "그렇군..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1524
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_346d70be:

    # "After a brief pause, he proceeded:"
    "짧은 침묵 후, 그가 말을 이었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1525
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d8c65580:

    # ALCOTT "What did you find in the fort? Did you recover anything?"
    ALCOTT "요새에서 뭘 찾았나? 뭔가 회수한 건 있나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1526
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6e12cd42:

    # MC "As I searched for an answer, I suddenly felt the faintest voice in the back of my head whispering something."
    MC "답을 찾으려 애쓰는 순간, 갑자기 머릿속 뒤쪽에서 무언가 속삭이는 아주 희미한 목소리가 느껴졌습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1527
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ddf0c2d1:

    # "Too distinct to be my own internal thoughts and yet..."
    "내 내면의 생각이라고 하기엔 너무나 또렷하고, 그런데도..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1528
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1dd8dbb8:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}No.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}아니.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1529
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7849ce3f:

    # MC "... No, sir."
    MC "... 아닙니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1530
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_55fad953:

    # "I noticed that Markus had realised I was lying — he quickly looked to hide his expression."
    "마르쿠스가 내가 거짓말하고 있다는 걸 눈치챘음을 나는 알아차렸다 — 그는 재빨리 표정을 감추려 애썼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1531
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_eee1e18d:

    # "The Emperor raised a curious eyebrow."
    "황제가 호기심 어린 눈썹을 치켜올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1532
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cb6cfe3e:

    # ALCOTT "{i}‘No’?{/i}"
    ALCOTT "{i}‘아니’라고?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1533
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_acc6fa77:

    # MC "Everything inside was destroyed, the Demorai must have reached it long before we did."
    MC "안에 있는 모든 것이 파괴되어 있었습니다, 데모라이가 우리보다 훨씬 먼저 도착했던 게 틀림없습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1534
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7b122b05:

    # "My foggy mind didn’t seem to bother lying straight to Alcott’s face."
    "흐릿한 내 정신은 알코트 앞에서 대놓고 거짓말하는 걸 전혀 개의치 않는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1535
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c69602a0_1:

    # ALCOTT "I see..."
    ALCOTT "그렇군..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1536
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5bc491e1:

    # MC "Everyone was killed, we barely made it out alive..."
    MC "모두 전사했습니다, 저희는 간신히 살아서 빠져나왔습니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1537
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a02226be:

    # "To my own surprise it effortlessly weaved together a story, line after line, of our escape."
    "놀랍게도, 내 입은 거침없이 이야기를 엮어나갔다. 우리의 탈출극을 한 줄 한 줄..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1538
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e14fa103:

    # ALCOTT "No survivors?"
    ALCOTT "생존자는 없나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1539
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d1f86cf3:

    # MC "We were the only ones."
    MC "저희만 살아남았습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1540
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d8270823:

    # "I felt as if {i}someone else{/i} took over."
    "마치 {i}다른 누군가가{/i} 나를 대신하고 있는 것만 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1541
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c27286:

    # ALCOTT "And how did you two escape exactly?"
    ALCOTT "그리고 너희 둘은 정확히 어떻게 탈출했지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1542
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a556510:

    # MC "We managed to make a break for it after locking ourselves away in the tunnels, sir."
    MC "터널 안에 몸을 숨긴 후에 간신히 탈출할 수 있었습니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1543
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5742e785:

    # MC "By nightfall they had left the fort, so we made our way back."
    MC "해질녘쯤 그들이 요새를 떠났기에, 저희는 돌아오는 길을 찾았습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1544
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7d7776a6:

    # "Alcott crossed his arms on his chestplate as he slowly paced the next question:"
    "알코트는 흉갑 위로 팔짱을 끼고 천천히 다음 질문을 던졌다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1545
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e654f18:

    # ALCOTT "You expect me to believe that you two made a month-long journey through enemy lands..."
    ALCOTT "너희 둘이 적진을 가로질러 한 달이나 걸리는 여정을 해냈다고 믿길 바라는 건가..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1546
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_44694190:

    # ALCOTT "On foot, alone, injured, starving..."
    ALCOTT "도보로, 단둘이, 부상당하고, 굶주린 채로..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1547
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d485f664:

    # ALCOTT "...{b}In one week?{/b}"
    ALCOTT "...{b}일주일 만에 말인가?{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1548
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c22aa46f:

    # "What?..."
    "뭐라고?..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1549
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_d7252fc7:

    # MC "A w— It’s only been a week?!"
    MC "일주—겨우 일주일밖에 안 지났다고요?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1550
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92549c50:

    # "Through just the slightest lowering of his eyebrows Alcott betrayed his surprise of my reaction."
    "아주 미세하게 눈썹을 낮추는 것만으로, 알코트는 내 반응에 대한 놀라움을 드러냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1551
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3303201a:

    # "Seconds later the emotionless mask was back in place."
    "몇 초 후, 감정 없는 가면이 다시 제자리를 찾았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1552
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_23bd3c52:

    # ALCOTT "Now give me {i}the truth{/i}."
    ALCOTT "이제 {i}진실{/i}을 말해 보게."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1553
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_718626ed:

    # MC "I... That’s all I can remember."
    MC "저... 그게 제가 기억할 수 있는 전부입니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1554
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cba3c031:

    # ALCOTT "Believe me when I say that you do not want to lie to me."
    ALCOTT "내게 거짓말하는 게 좋은 생각이 아니라는 건 믿어도 좋네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1555
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4c4b58d:

    # MC "My lord, it is the truth!"
    MC "각하, 이것이 진실입니다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1556
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6bbafbe2:

    # MC "I can only remember so much of the journey back."
    MC "돌아오는 여정은 그 정도밖에 기억나지 않습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1557
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_abbd9edb:

    # MC "The rest... If there was anything, it is {i}missing{/i}..."
    MC "나머지는... 뭔가 있었다 해도, {i}사라져{/i} 버렸습니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1558
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b9c59d79:

    # "Alcott looked over towards Markus."
    "알코트는 마르쿠스 쪽으로 시선을 돌렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1559
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5405cc9:

    # ALCOTT "What about you?"
    ALCOTT "너는 어떤가?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1560
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f83b330e:

    # ALCOTT "Do you have anything to add?"
    ALCOTT "덧붙일 말이라도 있나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1561
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efa73dec:

    # "Markus shook his head grimly."
    "마르쿠스는 굳은 표정으로 고개를 저었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1562
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c6a66cbe:

    # ALCOTT "How inconvenient."
    ALCOTT "참 난감하군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1563
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f8657076:

    # "Alcott took a thoughtful pause, then, as if remembered something, asked:"
    "알코트는 생각에 잠긴 듯 잠시 멈췄다가, 무언가 떠오른 듯 물었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1564
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3f6b14d4:

    # ALCOTT "Why were you both naked when we recovered you?"
    ALCOTT "우리가 발견했을 때 왜 둘 다 나체였지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1565
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_53ac8cdc:

    # MC "I... I don’t know, sir."
    MC "저... 잘 모르겠습니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1566
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_98755bac:

    # MC "Everything is daze, I’m sorry, my lord, it all feels like a nightmare..."
    MC "모든 게 몽롱합니다, 죄송합니다 각하, 모든 게 악몽 같습니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1567
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_58b51746:

    # ALCOTT "Hmm. I see."
    ALCOTT "흠. 그렇군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1568
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a0073a56:

    # ALCOTT "You best hope your memories return swiftly, there are still many questions about what has happened to the Second Scouts."
    ALCOTT "네 기억이 빨리 돌아오길 바라는 게 좋을 거야, 제2정찰대에 무슨 일이 있었는지 아직 질문이 많으니까."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1569
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_41fa21ba:

    # ALCOTT "Questions {i}I{/i} want answers to."
    ALCOTT "{i}내가{/i} 답을 원하는 질문들이지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1570
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b23d52c3:

    # MC "... I will do my best to remember, my lord."
    MC "... 기억해내기 위해 최선을 다하겠습니다, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1571
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e91bd01:

    # "I was convinced that Alcott did not entirely believe my story, but it must have satisfied him enough for now at least."
    "알코트가 내 이야기를 전적으로 믿지는 않았지만, 적어도 지금 당장은 그걸로 충분했으리라 확신했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1572
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_976a04cd:

    # ALCOTT "... In light of the unusual circumstances surrounding the Second Scouts Division and the danger you single-handedly faced along with the losses your unit suffered, you are both hereby relinquished of your duties as Scouts."
    ALCOTT "... 제2정찰사단을 둘러싼 특이한 상황과, 너희가 홀로 맞서 싸운 위험, 그리고 부대가 겪은 손실을 고려하여, 너희 둘은 이로써 정찰병으로서의 의무에서 해제된다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1573
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1bf8606f:

    # MC "Sir? You mean—"
    MC "각하? 그 말씀은—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1574
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_fd2f53f3:

    # ALCOTT "HOWEVER, the two of you shall instead sign up to the Adventurer’s Guild."
    ALCOTT "하지만, 대신에 너희 둘은 모험가 길드에 등록하도록."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1575
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3b1d3c63:

    # MC "The... The {i}Adventurer’s Guild?{/i}"
    MC "그... {i}모험가 길드{/i} 말입니까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1576
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_85f508b4:

    # ALCOTT "You are free to live and stay in the Capital unless the city itself falls under siege, upon which you, like all other able bodied, are still bound to heed the call to arms."
    ALCOTT "수도가 포위되지 않는 한 자유롭게 수도에 거주할 수 있으며, 포위될 경우에는 다른 모든 건장한 자들과 마찬가지로 소집에 응할 의무가 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1577
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_99546b5d:

    # ALCOTT "Elsewise you shall serve the Empire as Guild members instead."
    ALCOTT "그 외에는 길드원으로서 제국을 위해 봉사하라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1578
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f0433fc8:

    # ALCOTT "This is offered to you solely on the highly unusual circumstances surrounding your... survival."
    ALCOTT "이것은 오로지 너희의... 생존을 둘러싼 극히 이례적인 상황 때문에 주어지는 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1579
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2e2bde2d:

    # ALCOTT "You are now far more useful to me alive than dead."
    ALCOTT "이제 너희는 죽은 것보다 살아있는 게 내게 훨씬 더 쓸모 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1580
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b45d7d3:

    # ALCOTT "Both of you are forbidden to speak about your mission and its failure to anyone, understand?"
    ALCOTT "너희 둘 다 누구에게도 임무와 그 실패에 대해 말하는 것을 금한다, 알겠나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1581
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_623d4f96:

    # "Me and Markus both nodded, giving our best ‘yes, sirs’."
    "나와 마르쿠스는 둘 다 고개를 끄덕이며 최선의 ‘예, 각하’를 내놓았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1583
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e69568ef:

    # ALCOTT "In return for this you will both {i}also{/i} be required to help me with... {i}raising morale.{/i}"
    ALCOTT "그 대가로 너희 둘은 {i}또한{/i} 내가... {i}사기를 높이는{/i} 데 협조해야 한다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1584
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e35cd6bf:

    # "Both me and Markus just looked at each other, clueless."
    "나와 마르쿠스는 서로를 바라볼 뿐, 전혀 감을 잡지 못했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1585
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ef65ac0:

    # MC "... Sir?"
    MC "... 각하?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1586
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1255a968:

    # ALCOTT "As far as anyone is concerned, you two single-handedly and {i}bravely{/i} fought together, slaying dozens of Demorai and returned not as lone survivors, but as {i}heroes{/i}. Understand?"
    ALCOTT "앞으로 세상에 알려질 바로는, 너희 둘이 단둘이서 {i}용감하게{/i} 함께 싸워, 수십 명의 데모라이를 처치하고, 살아남은 패잔병이 아닌 {i}영웅{/i}으로서 귀환한 거다. 알겠나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1587
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5fbe41cb:

    # MC "But—"
    MC "하지만—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1588
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c5ee3b38:

    # ALCOTT "As of now, most of the city is talking about the two surviving heroes."
    ALCOTT "지금 이 순간, 도시 대부분이 두 명의 살아남은 영웅에 대해 이야기하고 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1589
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bc98f3ed:

    # ALCOTT "I intend to salvage something out of this affair to help people keep the faith."
    ALCOTT "나는 이번 일에서 뭔가 건져내어 백성들이 믿음을 잃지 않도록 할 생각이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1590
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_48409954:

    # ALCOTT "They {b}will not{/b} hear of the massacre that you walked into, that story will die in this room and you two will only speak of the bravery and courage of your comrades."
    ALCOTT "그들은 너희가 맞닥뜨린 학살에 대해 {b}듣지 않을{/b} 것이다, 그 이야기는 이 방에서 죽고, 너희 둘은 오직 전우들의 용기와 용맹에 대해서만 말할 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1591
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a5be7a25:

    # "The Emperor wants us..."
    "황제가 우리에게 바라는 건..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1592
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_363258d4:

    # "{i}To lie?{/i}"
    "{i}거짓말을 하라는 건가?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1593
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_e0c9d687:

    # ALCOTT "Given the fate you have managed to escape, visiting public places to wave and smile around is not such a bad alternative."
    ALCOTT "네가 간신히 피한 운명을 생각하면, 공공장소에 나가 손 흔들고 미소 짓는 건 그리 나쁜 대안이 아니지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1594
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0650d1f5:

    # ALCOTT "Don’t you agree?"
    ALCOTT "동의하지 않나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1595
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_58572838:

    # MC "... Yes, sir."
    MC "... 예, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1596
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_49b19704:

    # MARKUS "Yes, my lord."
    MARKUS "예, 각하."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1597
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_635c96ff:

    # ALCOTT "Good. I will leave you to rest now."
    ALCOTT "좋아. 이제 쉬도록 하게."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1598
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a378d60:

    # ALCOTT "Farewell."
    ALCOTT "잘 있거라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1600
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2c3737af:

    # "The Emperor sauntered off with his guards."
    "황제는 호위병들과 함께 유유히 걸어 나갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1601
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ce4fee07:

    # "I’ve let all the news sink in, then turned to Markus."
    "모든 소식을 가슴에 새기며, 나는 마르쿠스를 돌아봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1602
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a970dd63:

    # "A sense of immense joy ignited deep inside me, as I have realised..."
    "내면 깊은 곳에서 엄청난 기쁨이 타올랐다. 나는 깨달았다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1603
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ff83708f:

    # MC "We survived!"
    MC "우리 살아남았어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1604
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5d6ffb8b:

    # "Markus smiled back at me, and for the first time in what seemed like an eternity..."
    "마르쿠스도 나에게 미소 지었다. 그리고 영겁처럼 느껴지던 시간이 지나 처음으로..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1605
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9595e0c4:

    # "{i}We truly felt our nightmare was over.{/i}"
    "{i}우리는 진심으로 악몽이 끝났다고 느꼈다.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1612
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_fe3a2313:

    # "I awoke in the dead of night, drenched in sweat."
    "한밤중에 잠에서 깨어났다. 땀에 흠뻑 젖은 채였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1613
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c3ed7919:

    # "Strange dreams plagued me where black liquid permeated my lungs and slithered its way through my veins until it filled my whole body, suffocating me from the inside out."
    "검은 액체가 폐에 스며들어 핏줄을 타고 기어 다니며 온몸을 가득 채워, 안에서부터 나를 질식시키는 이상한 꿈들이 나를 괴롭혔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1615
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ddbb25d:

    # "Staggering out of bed, I dragged myself along the cold tiles over towards the stone taps."
    "침대에서 비틀거리며 일어나, 차가운 타일 바닥을 따라 돌로 된 수도꼭지 쪽으로 몸을 끌고 갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1617
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_adc05583:

    # "With both hands I splashed my face and—"
    "두 손으로 얼굴에 물을 끼얹었다—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1620
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1ebf59e4:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Hi...{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}안녕...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1622
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c8208279:

    # "I jumped backwards, looking frantically around for the guttural, dark voice that spoke to me."
    "나는 뒤로 펄쩍 뛰며, 나에게 말을 건 탁하고 어두운 목소리의 주인을 미친 듯이 찾았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1623
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_33055c12:

    # "There were those asleep on the ward, but no one else awake or stirring."
    "병실에는 잠든 사람들이 있었지만, 깨어 있거나 움직이는 사람은 아무도 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1624
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7f0765af:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Stop...{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}그만...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1625
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_27daad0b:

    # "I quickly wondered had I gone mad? Or had—"
    "나는 순간 내가 미친 건가 의심했다. 아니면—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1626
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7f0765af_1:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Stop...{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}그만...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1628
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2293d423:

    # "With both hands clasping at my head, I hit myself until..."
    "두 손으로 머리를 움켜쥐고, 나는 스스로를 때리기 시작했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1629
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_23880066:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}STOP!{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}그만해!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1630
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6bccf21f:

    # "My heart racing, with deep heavy breaths I whispered in my quietest voice."
    "심장이 미친 듯이 뛰고, 깊고 무거운 숨을 몰아쉬며 나는 가장 낮은 목소리로 속삭였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1631
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cf5edfd0:

    # MC "... Who are you? {i}Where{/i} are you?"
    MC "... 너 누구야? {i}어디{/i} 있는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1632
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_347d498f:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}In head.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}머릿속.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1633
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_19570c32:

    # MC "What?"
    MC "뭐?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1634
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_cc328b35:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}In head...{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}머릿속에...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1635
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a8f74446:

    # MC "What do you...? What do you want?"
    MC "뭘...? 뭘 원하는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1636
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_27502ef0:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Keep safe. Words... not... good... yet.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}안전을 지켜. 말이... 아직... 서툴러...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1637
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_a369139c:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Protect host.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}숙주를 보호.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1638
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8c1637ab:

    # MC "‘Host’? What are you—"
    MC "‘숙주’라고? 너 뭐야—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1640
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_484b449c:

    # "There was some shuffling from one of the beds, as I peered over to check, someone had simply rolled over onto their side and groaned a little, presumably in pain."
    "침대 중 하나에서 뒤척이는 소리가 들렸다. 확인해 보니, 누군가 그저 옆으로 몸을 돌리고 고통스러운 듯 작게 신음했을 뿐이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1641
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9c23f31e:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Learning... Assimilating...{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}학습 중... 동화 중...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1642
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_0fd32d36:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Need. Time. Talk. Better.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}시간 필요. 말. 더 잘.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1643
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_996126bd:

    # MC "... 그럼, 나를 해치지 않겠다는 거야?"
    MC "... 그럼, 나를 해치지 않겠다는 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1644
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_09f0dda8:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Protect... host.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}숙주... 보호.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1645
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8acf53a0:

    # BLACK_VOICE "{i}Need. Rest.{/i}"
    BLACK_VOICE "{i}휴식 필요.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1646
translate kr qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_97ae5882:

    # MC "Can’t sleep... It’s like I’m burning up..."
